&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The InMobi Culture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At InMobi, culture isn’t a buzzword; it&#39;s an ethos woven by every InMobian, reflecting our diverse backgrounds and experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We thrive on challenges and seize every opportunity for growth. Our core values — thinking big, being passionate, showing accountability, and taking ownership with freedom — guide us in every decision we make.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in nurturing and investing in your development through continuous learning and career progression with our InMobi Live Your Potential program.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;InMobi is proud to be an Equal Employment Opportunity employer and is committed to providing reasonable accommodations to qualified individuals with disabilities throughout the hiring process and in the workplace.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;fui-Link ___1rxvrpe f2hkw1w f3rmtva f1ewtqcl fyind8e f1k6fduh f1w7gpdv fk6fouc fjoy568 figsok6 f1hu3pq6 f11qmguv f19f4twv f1tyq0we f1g0x7ka fhxju0i f1qch9an f1cnd47f fqv5qza f1vmzxwi f1o700av f13mvf36 f1cmlufx f9n3di6 f1ids18y f1tx3yz7 f1deo86v f1eh06m1 f1iescvh fhgqx19 f1olyrje f1p93eir f1nev41a f1h8hb77 f1lqvz6u f10aw75t fsle3fq f17ae5zn&quot; href=&quot;https://nam04.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.inmobi.com%2Fcompany%2Fcareers&amp;amp;data=05%7C02%7Crichard.thomas%40inmobi.com%7Ce97eb886aa4d4c8e919608dc52d1cc2f%7C89359cf49e60409980c4775a0cfe27a7%7C0%7C0%7C638476308219536812%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;amp;sdata=FOJ4DKK6f1jjlteD9SlK%2FdMDUaZzdYsCFSU%2BX%2BvuCAo%3D&amp;amp;reserved=0&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;https://www.inmobi.com/company/careers&lt;/a&gt; to better understand our benefits, values, and more!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;272&quot; data-end=&quot;669&quot;&gt;Glance AI is an AI commerce platform shaping the next wave of e-commerce with inspiration-led shopping, less about searching for what you want and more about discovering who you could be. Operating in 140 countries, Glance AI transforms every screen into a stage for instant, personal, and joyful discovery, where inspiration becomes something you can explore, feel, and shop in the moment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;272&quot; data-end=&quot;669&quot;&gt;Its proprietary models, seamlessly integrated with Google’s most advanced AI platforms, Gemini and Imagen on Vertex AI, deliver hyper-realistic, deeply personal shopping experiences across categories such as fashion, beauty, travel, accessories, home décor, pets, and more. Designed to seamlessly integrate into everyday consumer technology, Glance AI reimagines the future of e-commerce with inspiration-led discovery and shopping.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;671&quot; data-end=&quot;1119&quot;&gt;With an open architecture built for effortless adoption across hardware and software ecosystems, Glance AI is creating a platform that can become a staple in everyday consumer technology. It partners with the world’s leading smartphone makers, connected TV manufacturers, telecom providers, and global brands — meeting people where they are: on mobile, smart TVs, and brand websites.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;671&quot; data-end=&quot;1119&quot;&gt;Through Glance AI’s rich first-party data and unparalleled consumer access, it harnesses InMobi’s global scale, insights, and targeting capabilities to create high-impact, performance-driven shopping journeys for brands worldwide. Part of the InMobi Group, a global technology and advertising leader reaching over 2 billion devices and serving more than 30,000 enterprise brands worldwide, Glance AI is backed by Google, Jio Platforms, and Mithril Capital.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1&gt;SDE 3, Machine Learning&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;About the Role&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an &lt;strong&gt;SDE 3, Machine Learning&lt;/strong&gt; to lead the technical architecture for Glance&#39;s AI shopping agent. You will own the core engineering for our ML Inference Platform, Evaluation Harnesses, and rapid 0→1 prototyping frameworks. In this role, you will set technical standards, design reliable distributed ML systems, and work across teams to scale complex agentic workflows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You Will Own &amp;amp; Build&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inference Platform Architecture:&lt;/strong&gt; Architect low-latency recommendation inference systems, distributed vector search, feature store integrations, and real-time streaming updates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Evaluation Infrastructure:&lt;/strong&gt; Build comprehensive offline and online evaluation pipelines, golden dataset testing tools, tool-call tracking, and automated regression suites.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agentic Core &amp;amp; New Initiatives:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead the engineering execution for rapid 0→1 prototyping of AI shopping agent features—building flexible orchestration runtimes, tool registries, and gateway middleware.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with Applied Science, Product, and Data Platform teams to translate complex research concepts into clean, production-grade systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What We Are Looking For&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;System Architecture:&lt;/strong&gt; Track record of designing, building, and scaling distributed ML systems and production serving pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deep ML Systems Knowledge:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience with model optimization (quantization, TensorRT, torch.compile), vector search indexing, and real-time feature delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agent &amp;amp; LLM Infrastructure:&lt;/strong&gt; Understanding of LLM orchestration, agentic tool-use harnesses, and multimodal model serving.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Influence:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to mentor engineers, guide design reviews, and raise the engineering bar across teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;You might thrive in this role if you have:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BTech or MTech in Computer Science, Machine Learning, or a related quantitative field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years of software engineering experience, with 5+ years dedicated to ML platforms, inference engines, or recommendation systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in building high-throughput, low-latency recommendation inference, vector search, and feature serving infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Python or Java, and production ML tools across PyTorch, Triton, and distributed frameworks (Ray/Spark).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience architecting automated evaluation harness suites and production monitoring for ML systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills—able to simplify complex systems and align stakeholders across product and engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-directed, curious, and comfortable driving ambiguous 0→1 technical initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ui-provider ee bcu auz bcv bcw bcx bcy bcz bda bdb bdc bdd bde bdf bdg bdh bdi bdj bdk bdl bdm bdn bdo bdp bdq bdr bds bdt bdu bdv bdw bdx bdy bdz bea&quot;&gt;&quot;&lt;em&gt;Glance collects and processes personal data such as your name, contact details, resume and other information that may contain personal data for the purpose of processing your application. Glance utilizes Greenhouse, a third-party platform. Please review Greenhouse&#39;s Privacy Policy to understand how the data collected from you is processed and managed. By clicking on &#39;Submit Application&#39;, you acknowledge and agree to the above privacy terms. Should you have any privacy concerns, you may contact us through the details mentioned in your application confirmation email.&quot;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Razorpay is one of India’s leading full-stack financial technology companies, powering the way businesses move, manage, and grow money. Founded in 2014 by Harshil Mathur and Shashank Kumar with a simple vision - to simplify payments for Indian businesses - we’ve since grown into a fintech powerhouse driving India’s digital payment revolution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Razorpay powers millions of businesses with a smarter, scalable stack that goes beyond transactions to help them truly build and grow.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;From building AI-native agentic payments, to AI-assisted fraud detection and real-time risk intelligence to automated reconciliation, smart payouts, and predictive financial insights, we are embedding intelligence across our stack to make money movement faster, safer, and more efficient. In close collaboration with ecosystem partners - including banks, networks, regulators - we are pioneering industry-first solutions that are shaping the next era of fintech&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Across India, Singapore and Malaysia, our products span everything from seamless checkouts to payroll automation - powering a fintech ecosystem that’s redefining how money moves across Asia.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Today, that ecosystem supports everyone from early-stage startups to some of India’s largest enterprises, enabling them to accept, process, and disburse payments at scale while expanding into new ways of managing money more efficiently.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our scale speaks volumes: Razorpay processes $180+ billion in annualized transactions, powering leading businesses like Airbnb, Facebook, WhatsApp, Airtel, CRED, BookmyShow, Zomato, Swiggy, Lenskart, Mirae Asset Capital markets, Indian Oil, National Pension Scheme - and over 100 of India’s unicorns. With strong roots in India and growing operations in Southeast Asia, we are shaping the next chapter of financial technology across the region.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are backed by global investors including GIC, Peak XV Partners (formerly Sequoia Capital India &amp;amp; SEA), Tiger Global, Ribbit Capital, Matrix Partners, MasterCard, and Salesforce Ventures, having raised over $740 million to date. Strategic acquisitions - including Ezetap (POS and offline payments), Curlec (Malaysia expansion), BillMe (digital invoicing), and POP (rewards-first UPI) - along with earlier moves in fraud prevention, payroll, and lending, have further strengthened our platform and widened our footprint across Asia.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;But what truly sets Razorpay apart is our culture. At Razorpay, ownership is our oxygen - you own what you build, with no micromanagement or red tape, just the runway to make your ideas fly. Learning is a lifestyle - if you’re curious, you’ll feel at home here. People &amp;gt; Pedigree - we hire for attitude, hustle, and hunger more than degrees. Transparency thrives over titles - this is where interns question CXOs and CXOs say “thank you.” Guided by our values of Customer First, Autonomy &amp;amp; Ownership, Agility with Integrity, Transparency, Challenging the status quo and a strong belief that Razorpay grows with Razors,&amp;nbsp; you’ll be part of a 3000+ strong team building not just products, but the financial infrastructure of the future.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Razorpay Ads is building a commerce media and audience intelligence business powered by Razorpay’s transaction ecosystem. We are looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Manager, Enterprise Partnership&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;to build and scale our relationships with leading media agencies, digital agencies, agency trading teams, and their advertiser portfolios.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a high-ownership role at the intersection of &lt;strong&gt;advertising, data, commerce, and fintech&lt;/strong&gt;. You will be responsible for making Razorpay Ads a strategic partner for agencies — helping them leverage Razorpay’s audience intelligence and media capabilities to solve advertiser objectives across performance, customer acquisition, brand building, audience targeting and measurement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role goes beyond selling individual campaigns. You will own agency relationships, develop advertiser pipelines within agency portfolios, unlock briefs and budgets, and build a repeatable agency-led revenue engine for Razorpay Ads.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Own&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agency Relationship &amp;amp; Business Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and own strategic relationships across leading agency networks, independent agencies and digital/performance agencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop strong relationships with senior stakeholders across &lt;strong&gt;agency leadership, investment, planning, strategy, digital, performance and account management teams&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish Razorpay Ads as a preferred partner for data-led, commerce-media and performance advertising solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create agency-level account plans covering priority agencies, key stakeholders, advertiser portfolios, opportunities and revenue potential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive regular agency engagements, capability sessions, workshops and joint client conversations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advertiser &amp;amp; Revenue Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify high-potential advertisers within agency portfolios and build a structured pipeline of briefs and opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with agency teams to understand advertiser objectives, media plans, campaign challenges and investment priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Convert agency relationships into &lt;strong&gt;active advertisers, repeat advertisers and scalable revenue opportunities&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the sales cycle from prospecting and solutioning through proposal, commercial negotiation, campaign closure and renewal.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive penetration across priority categories including &lt;strong&gt;BFSI, fintech, D2C, e-commerce, travel, consumer internet, auto and other digitally intensive categories&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build quarterly and annual agency revenue plans and maintain strong visibility on pipeline, closures and forecasts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Consultative &amp;amp; Solution Selling&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate advertiser and agency briefs into solutions using Razorpay Ads’ media, audience and data capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Position Razorpay’s transaction-led audience intelligence as a differentiated alternative or complement to conventional digital targeting signals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop solutions spanning &lt;strong&gt;audience intelligence, transaction-led targeting, onsite/offsite media, performance campaigns, brand campaigns and measurement&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build compelling narratives and proposals that connect Razorpay’s capabilities to measurable advertiser outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with agencies to create customized solutions rather than relying on standardized inventory-led selling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agency GTM&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a structured GTM strategy for priority agency groups and their advertiser portfolios.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Map agency stakeholders, key accounts, upcoming pitches, annual planning cycles and seasonal/festive opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities for agency-level partnerships, preferred partner programs, joint pitches and advertiser workshops.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop repeatable playbooks for converting agency relationships into briefs, campaigns and recurring advertiser investments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Razorpay Ads at relevant agency forums, industry conversations and advertiser engagements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Campaign Success &amp;amp; Account Growth&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Campaign Management, Product and Operations teams to ensure campaigns deliver against advertiser objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay engaged beyond campaign closure to ensure strong advertiser and agency experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use campaign results and insights to drive renewals, upsells and larger annual commitments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to expand successful campaigns across brands, categories and agency teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build case studies and proof points that can accelerate adoption across the wider agency ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Market Intelligence &amp;amp; Product Feedback&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a strong understanding of the Indian digital advertising ecosystem, agency structures, advertiser budgets and emerging media trends.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track competitive offerings across ad networks, commerce media, retail media, audience platforms and large digital publishers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring structured agency and advertiser feedback to Product, Strategy and Campaign teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help shape Razorpay Ads’ positioning, packaging, pricing and product roadmap based on market demand.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Success Looks Like&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Success in this role will be measured primarily through:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agency penetration:&lt;/strong&gt; Depth and quality of relationships across priority agencies and senior agency stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Active advertisers:&lt;/strong&gt; Number of advertisers activated through the agency ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Quality advertisers:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to acquire strategic advertisers with meaningful and scalable budget potential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advertiser retention:&lt;/strong&gt; Repeat campaigns and continued investment from activated advertisers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pipeline creation:&lt;/strong&gt; Strength and quality of advertiser briefs and qualified opportunities generated through agencies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Revenue:&lt;/strong&gt; Achievement of quarterly and annual revenue objectives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic relationships:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to convert transactional agency relationships into long-term partnerships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5–8 years of experience&lt;/strong&gt; in agency sales, digital advertising, media sales, adtech, commerce media, publisher sales or related businesses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong existing relationships across &lt;strong&gt;media agencies, digital agencies and/or performance agencies&lt;/strong&gt; in India.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience selling digital advertising solutions through agencies and influencing advertiser budgets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of the digital advertising ecosystem including &lt;strong&gt;Meta, Google, programmatic, publisher media, performance marketing and brand advertising&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to engage comfortably with stakeholders ranging from agency planners and account leads to Business Heads, Managing Partners and CXOs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong consultative selling and solutioning capabilities — able to start with a client problem rather than an inventory proposition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial orientation with experience owning pipelines, negotiations and revenue targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good understanding of advertising metrics including CPM, CPC, CTR, CPL, CPA, ROAS, reach, frequency and brand/measurement metrics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to interpret campaign performance and convert results into a compelling growth narrative.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong presentation, communication and negotiation skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High ownership, bias for action and comfort operating in an early-stage business where GTM playbooks are still being built.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong Plus&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working at an &lt;strong&gt;ad network, large digital publisher, commerce/retail media network, DSP, adtech platform or agency partnership function&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Existing relationships across leading agency networks and independent digital agencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling to BFSI, fintech, D2C, e-commerce or consumer internet advertisers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling both &lt;strong&gt;performance and branding solutions&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to first-party data, audience intelligence, CDPs, clean rooms, retail/commerce media or transaction-led advertising.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building a new agency channel or GTM motion from an early stage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Person We’d Like to Hire&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for someone who is &lt;strong&gt;well-networked but not dependent on their network; commercially aggressive but consultative in approach; comfortable selling what exists today while helping shape what needs to be built tomorrow&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate understands how agencies operate, knows how budgets and briefs move through the ecosystem, can open senior-level conversations, and has the persistence and strategic thinking required to turn those relationships into a sustainable revenue engine for Razorpay Ads.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;gmail_default&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;m_2989597180337834284gmail-m_4972969247898306296gmail-docs-internal-guid-3a65a3c2-7fff-88ff-9e94-8ab11a050d04&quot;&gt;Razorpay believes in and follows an equal employment opportunity policy that doesn&#39;t discriminate on gender, religion, sexual orientation, colour, nationality, age, etc. We welcome interests and applications from all groups and communities across the globe. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;gmail_default&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;gmail_default&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;m_2989597180337834284gmail-m_4972969247898306296gmail-docs-internal-guid-3d0a9248-7fff-a2fd-6fa3-5026f85768d7&quot;&gt;Follow us on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/razorpay/mycompany/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.linkedin.com/company/razorpay/mycompany/&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1660290870959000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw0f6sCrv8Ce3IHBvN2Sev8Z&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt; &amp;amp; &lt;a href=&quot;https://twitter.com/Razorpay&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://twitter.com/Razorpay&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1660290870959000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw0ViuP9uutFg1qFCm2nHeh1&quot;&gt;Twitter&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Razorpay is one of India’s leading full-stack financial technology companies, powering the way businesses move, manage, and grow money. Founded in 2014 by Harshil Mathur and Shashank Kumar with a simple vision - to simplify payments for Indian businesses - we’ve since grown into a fintech powerhouse driving India’s digital payment revolution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Razorpay powers millions of businesses with a smarter, scalable stack that goes beyond transactions to help them truly build and grow.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;From building AI-native agentic payments, to AI-assisted fraud detection and real-time risk intelligence to automated reconciliation, smart payouts, and predictive financial insights, we are embedding intelligence across our stack to make money movement faster, safer, and more efficient. In close collaboration with ecosystem partners - including banks, networks, regulators - we are pioneering industry-first solutions that are shaping the next era of fintech&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Across India, Singapore and Malaysia, our products span everything from seamless checkouts to payroll automation - powering a fintech ecosystem that’s redefining how money moves across Asia.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Today, that ecosystem supports everyone from early-stage startups to some of India’s largest enterprises, enabling them to accept, process, and disburse payments at scale while expanding into new ways of managing money more efficiently.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our scale speaks volumes: Razorpay processes $180+ billion in annualized transactions, powering leading businesses like Airbnb, Facebook, WhatsApp, Airtel, CRED, BookmyShow, Zomato, Swiggy, Lenskart, Mirae Asset Capital markets, Indian Oil, National Pension Scheme - and over 100 of India’s unicorns. With strong roots in India and growing operations in Southeast Asia, we are shaping the next chapter of financial technology across the region.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are backed by global investors including GIC, Peak XV Partners (formerly Sequoia Capital India &amp;amp; SEA), Tiger Global, Ribbit Capital, Matrix Partners, MasterCard, and Salesforce Ventures, having raised over $740 million to date. Strategic acquisitions - including Ezetap (POS and offline payments), Curlec (Malaysia expansion), BillMe (digital invoicing), and POP (rewards-first UPI) - along with earlier moves in fraud prevention, payroll, and lending, have further strengthened our platform and widened our footprint across Asia.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;But what truly sets Razorpay apart is our culture. At Razorpay, ownership is our oxygen - you own what you build, with no micromanagement or red tape, just the runway to make your ideas fly. Learning is a lifestyle - if you’re curious, you’ll feel at home here. People &amp;gt; Pedigree - we hire for attitude, hustle, and hunger more than degrees. Transparency thrives over titles - this is where interns question CXOs and CXOs say “thank you.” Guided by our values of Customer First, Autonomy &amp;amp; Ownership, Agility with Integrity, Transparency, Challenging the status quo and a strong belief that Razorpay grows with Razors,&amp;nbsp; you’ll be part of a 3000+ strong team building not just products, but the financial infrastructure of the future.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Razorpay&#39;s IFSC entity operates as a Payment Service Provider (PSP) regulated by the International Financial Services Centres Authority (IFSCA). This role sits within the Risk Management function and is responsible for risk identification, monitoring and management across the entity&#39;s business activities in line with IFSCA requirements. The incumbent will work closely with Operations and Compliance to implement the IFSCA risk-based approach – covering business risk assessment, customer risk assessment and enterprise-wide risk assessment from an AML-CFT and KYC perspective – and will support the designated official at the IFSC level in ensuring payment service activities are carried out in line with the risk management practices set out in Board-approved policies.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Risk Identification &amp;amp; Management: &lt;/strong&gt;Identify, assess and monitor business, customer and enterprise-wide risks in line with IFSCA&#39;s risk-based approach and the entity&#39;s risk management policies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Transaction Monitoring: &lt;/strong&gt;Monitor transactions for unusual or suspicious patterns, investigate system-generated alerts, and escalate red flags for further action within defined timelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sanction Screening: &lt;/strong&gt;Conduct sanction and watchlist screening of customers and transactions, and ensure timely and accurate closure of screening alerts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fraud &amp;amp; Chargeback Management: &lt;/strong&gt;Review and manage fraud cases and chargebacks, identify patterns and trends, and recommend controls to mitigate recurring risks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SAR Reporting: &lt;/strong&gt;Prepare Suspicious Activity Reports (SARs) with complete supporting documentation and submit them to the Compliance Officer accurately and within prescribed timelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AML-CFT &amp;amp; KYC Risk Assessments: &lt;/strong&gt;Support business risk assessment, customer risk assessment and enterprise-wide risk assessment from an AML-CFT and KYC standpoint, in coordination with the Compliance function.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-functional Coordination: &lt;/strong&gt;Partner with the Operations and Compliance teams to ensure risk management practices are consistently implemented across payment service activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Policy Adherence &amp;amp; MIS: &lt;/strong&gt;Ensure adherence to approved risk management policies and procedures, and maintain accurate records and MIS for internal review and regulatory reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Qualifications and Skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education: &lt;/strong&gt;Graduate/Postgraduate degree in Finance, Commerce, Business Administration or a related field. A certification such as CAMS (Certified Anti-Money Laundering Specialist) is an added advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 2 to 4 years of relevant experience in risk management, AML/KYC, transaction monitoring,sanction screening, or fraud and chargeback management – preferably within a bank, NBFC, payment aggregator/PSP, or fintech organisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Technical Skills:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of AML-CFT, KYC and sanctions screening frameworks and processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with IFSCA regulations applicable to payment service providers, or general knowledge of RBI/payment industry regulatory frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with transaction monitoring and case management systems, and strong working knowledge of MS Excel for data analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Soft Skills:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and investigative skills with close attention to detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear written communication skills for report writing and SAR documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work independently and coordinate effectively across Operations, Compliance and other functions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High ethical standards and integrity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;gmail_default&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;m_2989597180337834284gmail-m_4972969247898306296gmail-docs-internal-guid-3a65a3c2-7fff-88ff-9e94-8ab11a050d04&quot;&gt;Razorpay believes in and follows an equal employment opportunity policy that doesn&#39;t discriminate on gender, religion, sexual orientation, colour, nationality, age, etc. We welcome interests and applications from all groups and communities across the globe. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;gmail_default&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;gmail_default&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;m_2989597180337834284gmail-m_4972969247898306296gmail-docs-internal-guid-3d0a9248-7fff-a2fd-6fa3-5026f85768d7&quot;&gt;Follow us on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/razorpay/mycompany/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.linkedin.com/company/razorpay/mycompany/&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1660290870959000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw0f6sCrv8Ce3IHBvN2Sev8Z&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt; &amp;amp; &lt;a href=&quot;https://twitter.com/Razorpay&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://twitter.com/Razorpay&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1660290870959000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw0ViuP9uutFg1qFCm2nHeh1&quot;&gt;Twitter&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;InMobi Advertising&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is a global technology leader helping marketers win the moments that matter. Our advertising platform reaches over 2 billion people across 150+ countries and turns real-time context into business outcomes, delivering results grounded in privacy-first principles. Trusted by 30,000+ brands and leading publishers, InMobi is where intelligence, creativity, and accountability converge. By combining lock screens, apps, TVs, and the open web with AI and machine learning, we deliver receptive attention, precise personalization, and measurable impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Through &lt;strong&gt;Glance AI,&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;we are shaping AI Commerce, reimagining the future of e-commerce with inspiration-led discovery and shopping. Designed to seamlessly integrate into everyday consumer technology, Glance AI transforms every screen into a gateway for instant, personal, and joyful discovery.&amp;nbsp; Spanning diverse categories such as fashion, beauty, travel, accessories, home décor, pets, and beyond, Glance AI delivers deeply personalized shopping experiences.&amp;nbsp;With rich first-party data and unparalleled consumer access, it harnesses InMobi’s global scale, insights, and targeting capabilities to create high impact, performance driven shopping journeys for brands worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Recognized as a Great Place to Work, and by MIT Technology Review, Fast Company’s Top 10 Innovators, and more, InMobi is a workplace where bold ideas create global impact. Backed by investors including SoftBank, Kleiner Perkins, and Sherpalo Ventures, InMobi has offices across San Mateo, New York, London, Singapore, Tokyo, Seoul, Jakarta, Bengaluru and beyond.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;InMobi Advertising&lt;/strong&gt;, you’ll have the opportunity to shape how billions of users connect with content, commerce, and brands worldwide. To learn more, visit &lt;a id=&quot;menur1hur&quot; class=&quot;fui-Link ___1q1shib f2hkw1w f3rmtva f1ewtqcl fyind8e f1k6fduh f1w7gpdv fk6fouc fjoy568 figsok6 f1s184ao f1mk8lai fnbmjn9 f1o700av f13mvf36 f1cmlufx f9n3di6 f1ids18y f1tx3yz7 f1deo86v f1eh06m1 f1iescvh fhgqx19 f1olyrje f1p93eir f1nev41a f1h8hb77 f1lqvz6u f10aw75t fsle3fq f17ae5zn&quot; href=&quot;http://www.inmobi.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;www.inmobi.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Overview of the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an Applied Scientist III to join our algorithmic and research science team. You&#39;ll work on mathematically rigorous, research-driven problems at production scale, while owning problems end to end. This role sits at the intersection of theory and application, designing algorithms that combine elegant modeling with measurable business impact. Specifically, our scientists tackle challenges across traffic shaping, fraud detection, ad quality, pricing strategies, and auction theory, along with their practical applications. We leverage the latest deep learning models alongside classical machine learning techniques to build innovative solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the heart of the InMobi Exchange, our team optimizes the company&#39;s core business functions and creates the strategic moat that sets us apart in the market. As an Applied Scientist, you will not just &quot;use models&quot;—you will formulate them, evaluate their assumptions, tailor them to our problem domain, and bring them to life in production. Many of our challenges have no off-the-shelf solutions; we require scientific creativity to bridge research and reality.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you thrive on solving complex, high-impact problems and want to see your ideas shape the future of a global exchange, this is the place where your work will truly make a difference.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The impact you&#39;ll make:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Formulate, analyze, and implement algorithms that power real-time auctions, dynamic pricing, bid shaping, pacing, and traffic allocation across a massive-scale ad marketplace.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and experiment with methods in online learning, reinforcement learning, multi-armed bandits, forecasting, game theory, and Bayesian modeling—in non-stationary, adversarial environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with product and engineering teams to deploy your models in production and run real-world experiments with rapid feedback loops (measured in hours, not weeks).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in scientific design reviews and contribute to raising the methodological bar of the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the scientific community by publishing high-quality research, conducting internal seminars, and staying abreast of advances in machine learning, algorithms, and applied statistics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate the long-term dynamics of deployed algorithms, incorporating feedback, exploitation-exploration trade-offs, and incentives within multi-agent systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help identify new areas for innovation by translating business challenges into research questions and proposing novel, high-impact methodologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate mathematical ideas into practical, high-performance algorithms that operate at scale in production environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Explore and close the loop between model predictions and real-world outcomes, refining algorithms based on system behavior.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The experience we need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A Ph.D. in Computer Science, Statistics, Mathematics, Operations Research, Physics, or a related quantitative discipline is strongly preferred. A degree is not a hard requirement—demonstrated research depth and production impact count.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4–7 years of experience working on algorithmic or applied research problems, including significant production deployment experience. Candidates with more or less experience are welcome to apply—we hire across Applied Scientist II, Applied Scientist III, and Staff Applied Scientist levels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep grounding in one or more of:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Statistical learning theory, mathematical optimization, discrete algorithms, probability theory, and information theory&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Causal inference, decision theory, game theory, auction theory&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Online learning, bandits, RL, Bayesian methods&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong publication record (e.g., NeurIPS, ICML, AISTATS, KDD, UAI, WSDM, EC, SODA, COLT) is a strong plus—even if not recent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in scientific computing with Python, including packages such as NumPy, SciPy, PyTorch, or TensorFlow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working with big data platforms like Apache Spark, distributed computing, and large-scale datasets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A researcher&#39;s mindset: questions first, implementation later. You are thoughtful about assumptions and rigorous about validation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;End-to-end ownership: you can go from idea to production and thrive in applied settings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Prior experience in ad tech, marketplaces, or dynamic pricing is helpful but not required.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The InMobi Culture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At InMobi, culture isn’t a buzzword; it&#39;s an ethos woven by every InMobian, reflecting our diverse backgrounds and experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We thrive on challenges and seize every opportunity for growth. Our core values — thinking big, being passionate, showing accountability, and taking ownership with freedom — guide us in every decision we make.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in nurturing and investing in your development through continuous learning and career progression with our InMobi Live Your Potential program.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;InMobi is proud to be an Equal Employment Opportunity employer and is committed to providing reasonable accommodations to qualified individuals with disabilities throughout the hiring process and in the workplace.&lt;/p&gt;
