&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT THE ROLE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;InMobi&#39;s APAC marketing team builds demand and brand preference among advertisers, agencies and app publishers across India, Southeast Asia, Australia – New Zealand, Japan, China and South Korea. We are looking for an Integrated Marketing Lead to own India and Korea’s end-to-end marketing program: the campaigns that generate pipeline, the events and partnerships that build relationships, and the calendar and budget that hold it all together. This is a hands-on lead role for someone equally comfortable building a quarterly plan with sales leadership, briefing a paid media agency, and working a booth on day three of an industry conference.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the integrated marketing plan. &lt;/strong&gt;Build and run a quarterly and annual plan across demand generation, events, content and partnerships, aligned to regional revenue targets and priority segments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive B2B demand generation. &lt;/strong&gt;Design and execute multi-channel campaigns (events, PR and comms, paid media, email, LinkedIn, webinars, ABM) targeting brands, agencies and publishers; own MQL and pipeline-contribution targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Run the regional event portfolio. &lt;/strong&gt;Lead InMobi&#39;s presence at industry events and owned formats — from sponsorship selection and booth experience to executive roundtables, customer dinners and post-event follow-up.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build partner and co-marketing programs. &lt;/strong&gt;Work with agency groups, platform partners and industry bodies on joint campaigns, research, awards and speaking opportunities that extend reach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the calendar and the budget. &lt;/strong&gt;Maintain a single source of truth for India and Korea’s marketing calendar; allocate and track spend across markets and channels, forecast quarterly, and reallocate based on performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner with sales. &lt;/strong&gt;Act as the marketing counterpart for regional sales leaders — align on target accounts, build campaign-to-pipeline visibility, and enable teams with the right assets and follow-up motions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Measure and report. &lt;/strong&gt;Define KPIs, localize global product messaging for APAC markets, and report monthly on spend efficiency, pipeline influence and program ROI to regional and global leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT WE&#39;RE LOOKING FOR&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4-6 years of B2B marketing experience, with at least 3 years running integrated or demand-generation programs across multiple APAC markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of owning pipeline or MQL targets and reporting on marketing&#39;s contribution to revenue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience delivering large industry events and field marketing programs end to end, including sponsorship negotiation and on-site execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ownership of a marketing budget — planning, allocation, tracking and in-quarter reprioritisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency with the modern marketing stack (e.g. Marketo, HubSpot or Pardot, Salesforce, LinkedIn Campaign Manager) and comfort working in dashboards and spreadsheets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication in English, and the judgement to tailor a message across very different APAC markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ad tech, martech, SaaS or digital media experience preferred, with familiarity with the advertiser–agency ecosystem and willingness to travel across APAC roughly 20–25% of the time.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;Since 2007, InMobi has built the extraordinary. Beyond just technology. It has built a way of working.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Across 16 offices globally, through every pivot and breakthrough, one thing has remained constant: we are Builders, Dreamers, Doers. We are fluid enough to move fast, grounded enough to own outcomes, and human enough to care deeply about the work and about one another.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
