&lt;li&gt;Work towards meeting monthly, quarterly and annual revenue and monetization targets. Maintain regular, accurate forecasts and a healthy pipeline of opportunities.&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
