&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Own and evolve the global events strategy, including marquee industry conferences, bespoke customer and CXO programs, webinars, and branded experiences that deepen relationships and elevate brand perception.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Ensure all event creative and content support pipeline goals and reinforce InMobi Group&#39;s market leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Social, Partnerships &amp;amp; Sponsorships&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
