&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Lead InMobi Group&#39;s enterprise social strategy to grow reach, influence, and engagement across key channels, including LinkedIn and beyond.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Identify, negotiate, and manage industry partnerships, co-marketing opportunities, and sponsorships that meaningfully amplify visibility and influence.&lt;/li&gt;
