&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;InMobi Advertising&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is a global technology leader helping marketers win the moments that matter. Our advertising platform reaches over 2 billion people across 150+ countries and turns real-time context into business outcomes, delivering results grounded in privacy-first principles. Trusted by 30,000+ brands and leading publishers, InMobi is where intelligence, creativity, and accountability converge. By combining lock screens, apps, TVs, and the open web with AI and machine learning, we deliver receptive attention, precise personalization, and measurable impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Through &lt;strong&gt;Glance AI,&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;we are shaping AI Commerce, reimagining the future of e-commerce with inspiration-led discovery and shopping. Designed to seamlessly integrate into everyday consumer technology, Glance AI transforms every screen into a gateway for instant, personal, and joyful discovery.&amp;nbsp; Spanning diverse categories such as fashion, beauty, travel, accessories, home décor, pets, and beyond, Glance AI delivers deeply personalized shopping experiences.&amp;nbsp;With rich first-party data and unparalleled consumer access, it harnesses InMobi’s global scale, insights, and targeting capabilities to create high impact, performance driven shopping journeys for brands worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Recognized as a Great Place to Work, and by MIT Technology Review, Fast Company’s Top 10 Innovators, and more, InMobi is a workplace where bold ideas create global impact. Backed by investors including SoftBank, Kleiner Perkins, and Sherpalo Ventures, InMobi has offices across San Mateo, New York, London, Singapore, Tokyo, Seoul, Jakarta, Bengaluru and beyond.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;InMobi Advertising&lt;/strong&gt;, you’ll have the opportunity to shape how billions of users connect with content, commerce, and brands worldwide. To learn more, visit &lt;a id=&quot;menur1hur&quot; class=&quot;fui-Link ___1q1shib f2hkw1w f3rmtva f1ewtqcl fyind8e f1k6fduh f1w7gpdv fk6fouc fjoy568 figsok6 f1s184ao f1mk8lai fnbmjn9 f1o700av f13mvf36 f1cmlufx f9n3di6 f1ids18y f1tx3yz7 f1deo86v f1eh06m1 f1iescvh fhgqx19 f1olyrje f1p93eir f1nev41a f1h8hb77 f1lqvz6u f10aw75t fsle3fq f17ae5zn&quot; href=&quot;http://www.inmobi.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;www.inmobi.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a highly driven operator to support and scale our Search &amp;amp; Performance Monetization business. This role will work closely with the revenue lead to drive day-to-day execution across product, tech, finance, legal, and external partners, ensuring seamless operations, faster go-to-market, and sustained revenue growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will act as the connective tissue across teams — translating strategy into execution, unblocking dependencies, and building the operational backbone of a high-growth monetization engine.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Cross-Functional Execution &amp;amp; Program Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive end-to-end execution of key initiatives across Product, Engineering, Finance, Legal, and Partnerships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own program timelines, track deliverables, and ensure on-time launches of monetization features and GTM initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the central POC to align internal teams and external stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Partner &amp;amp; Stakeholder Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage day-to-day relationships with external partners (search providers, aggregators, demand partners)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate onboarding, integrations, and ongoing performance tracking with partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure smooth communication, issue resolution, and optimization cycles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Monetization Operations &amp;amp; Optimization&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor performance across O&amp;amp;O platforms and supply channels, identifying gaps and optimization opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with analytics and product teams to improve yield, fill rates, and revenue efficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support experimentation frameworks (A/B tests, new formats, pricing models)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; GTM &amp;amp; Platform Enablement Support&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist in executing GTM strategies for search and performance monetization offerings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support rollout and operations of self-serve / partner platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate across teams to ensure readiness for launches (product, legal, finance, billing, reporting)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Process Building &amp;amp; Scalability&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and streamline operational processes across partner onboarding, reporting, billing, and compliance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify inefficiencies and implement scalable solutions to support rapid growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain documentation, playbooks, and SOPs for repeatable execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Commercial &amp;amp; Financial Coordination&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Finance on billing, invoicing, revenue reconciliation, and forecasting inputs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support commercial discussions with data, reporting, and performance insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure alignment on contracts, commercials, and compliance requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5–7 years of experience&lt;/strong&gt; in program management, business operations, partnerships, or monetization roles (preferably in ad-tech, search, or performance marketing)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong ability to &lt;strong&gt;manage cross-functional stakeholders&lt;/strong&gt; and drive execution in a fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High ownership mindset with attention to detail and problem-solving ability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort working with &lt;strong&gt;data, dashboards, and performance metrics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and organizational skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with &lt;strong&gt;search monetization, performance marketing, or ad-tech ecosystems&lt;/strong&gt; is a strong plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why This Role Matters&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is critical to translating strategy into reality. You’ll be directly enabling the scale-up of a high-impact revenue pillar, working at the intersection of product, partnerships, and monetization — with clear visibility into business outcomes and growth.&lt;/p&gt;
