&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;text-align: justify; line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who are we and What do we do?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify; line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;InMobi Group’s mission is to power intelligent, mobile-first experiences for enterprises and consumers. Its businesses across advertising, marketing, data and content platforms are shaping consumer experience in a world of connected devices. InMobi Group has been recognized on both the 2018 and 2019 CNBC Disruptor 50 list and as one of Fast Company’s 2018 World’s Most Innovative Companies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1 style=&quot;text-align: justify; line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;What’s the InMobi family like?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify; line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Consistently featured among the “Great Places to Work” in India since 2017, our culture is our true north, enabling us to think big, solve complex challenges and grow with new opportunities. InMobians are passionate and driven, creative and fun-loving, take ownership and are results-focused. We invite you to free yourself, dream big and chase your passion.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1 style=&quot;text-align: justify; line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;What do we promise?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify; line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;We offer an opportunity to have an immediate impact on the company and our products. The work that you shall do will be mission-critical for InMobi and will be critical for optimizing tech operations, working with highly capable and ambitious peer groups. At InMobi, you get food for your body, soul, and mind with daily meals, gym, and yoga classes, cutting-edge training, and tools, cocktails at drink cart Thursdays and fun at work on Funky Fridays. We even promise to let you bring your kids and pets to work.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1 style=&quot;text-align: justify; line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;What you will be doing?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Drafting and reviewing a wide array of legal and commercial agreements, encompassing negotiation and ensuring comprehensive closure of such agreements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Coordinating closely with external legal counsels, advisors, and consultants to oversee the intricacies of commercial transactions and provide advisories, while also liaising with internal teams to ensure seamless end-to-end closure.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Offering informed guidance to internal stakeholders on general statutory compliances and effectively managing disputes, which may entail drafting and/or responding to legal notices.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Playing a pivotal role in the development, onboarding, implementation, and administration of systems and processes aimed at ensuring that contracts executed with employees, business partners, sourcing vendors, and contractors align with legal requirements and adhere to InMobi policy standards.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Taking lead in spearheading changes in contracts-related processes, including the development of templates and tools tailored to a diverse range of agreements such as office leases, sourcing agreements, consulting agreements, publisher agreements, advertiser agreements, data partnerships, agency agreements, marketing agreements, and vendor agreements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Providing assistance with general legal and risk mitigation advisories, as well as compliance activities, to multifunctional teams across various domains including security, government compliance, finance, privacy, and regulatory affairs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1 style=&quot;text-align: justify; line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;What do we expect?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Qualified law graduate from India, with approximately 4-7 years of professional experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Preference for candidates with a diverse background, including both in-house and law firm experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Prior experience providing legal support to engineering, IT, and internet-based organizations, especially in ad-tech or tech sectors, would be preferred.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Preference for candidates familiar with SaaS contracts, commercial and employment laws, and practices at a global level, particularly in the APAC region.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Demonstrated commitment to ethics, with a strong emphasis on personal integrity and impeccable professional conduct.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Proficient communication skills, coupled with the ability to handle matters independently and instill confidence in teams, executive management, and peers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Ability to collaborate effectively in cross-functional teams and a propensity to challenge the status quo, seeking to develop innovative solutions to address concerns.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Proven track record of delivering high-quality legal services efficiently in a corporate environment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1 style=&quot;text-align: justify; line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify; line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;You will contribute to creating disruptive and innovative consumer experiences using technology. We value autonomy, collaboration, technical innovation, and results-oriented thinking. InMobi’s culture is all about rewarding excellence so there are fantastic opportunities for the right candidates!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The InMobi Culture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At InMobi, culture isn’t a buzzword; it&#39;s an ethos woven by every InMobian, reflecting our diverse backgrounds and experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We thrive on challenges and seize every opportunity for growth. Our core values — thinking big, being passionate, showing accountability, and taking ownership with freedom — guide us in every decision we make.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in nurturing and investing in your development through continuous learning and career progression with our InMobi Live Your Potential program.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;InMobi is proud to be an Equal Employment Opportunity employer and is committed to providing reasonable accommodations to qualified individuals with disabilities throughout the hiring process and in the workplace.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;fui-Link ___1rxvrpe f2hkw1w f3rmtva f1ewtqcl fyind8e f1k6fduh f1w7gpdv fk6fouc fjoy568 figsok6 f1hu3pq6 f11qmguv f19f4twv f1tyq0we f1g0x7ka fhxju0i f1qch9an f1cnd47f fqv5qza f1vmzxwi f1o700av f13mvf36 f1cmlufx f9n3di6 f1ids18y f1tx3yz7 f1deo86v f1eh06m1 f1iescvh fhgqx19 f1olyrje f1p93eir f1nev41a f1h8hb77 f1lqvz6u f10aw75t fsle3fq f17ae5zn&quot; href=&quot;https://nam04.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.inmobi.com%2Fcompany%2Fcareers&amp;amp;data=05%7C02%7Crichard.thomas%40inmobi.com%7Ce97eb886aa4d4c8e919608dc52d1cc2f%7C89359cf49e60409980c4775a0cfe27a7%7C0%7C0%7C638476308219536812%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;amp;sdata=FOJ4DKK6f1jjlteD9SlK%2FdMDUaZzdYsCFSU%2BX%2BvuCAo%3D&amp;amp;reserved=0&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;https://www.inmobi.com/company/careers&lt;/a&gt; to better understand our benefits, values, and more!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;InMobi Advertising&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is a global technology leader helping marketers win the moments that matter. Our advertising platform reaches over 2 billion people across 150+ countries and turns real-time context into business outcomes, delivering results grounded in privacy-first principles. Trusted by 30,000+ brands and leading publishers, InMobi is where intelligence, creativity, and accountability converge. By combining lock screens, apps, TVs, and the open web with AI and machine learning, we deliver receptive attention, precise personalization, and measurable impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Through &lt;strong&gt;Glance AI,&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;we are shaping AI Commerce, reimagining the future of e-commerce with inspiration-led discovery and shopping. Designed to seamlessly integrate into everyday consumer technology, Glance AI transforms every screen into a gateway for instant, personal, and joyful discovery.&amp;nbsp; Spanning diverse categories such as fashion, beauty, travel, accessories, home décor, pets, and beyond, Glance AI delivers deeply personalized shopping experiences.&amp;nbsp;With rich first-party data and unparalleled consumer access, it harnesses InMobi’s global scale, insights, and targeting capabilities to create high impact, performance driven shopping journeys for brands worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Recognized as a Great Place to Work, and by MIT Technology Review, Fast Company’s Top 10 Innovators, and more, InMobi is a workplace where bold ideas create global impact. Backed by investors including SoftBank, Kleiner Perkins, and Sherpalo Ventures, InMobi has offices across San Mateo, New York, London, Singapore, Tokyo, Seoul, Jakarta, Bengaluru and beyond.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;InMobi Advertising&lt;/strong&gt;, you’ll have the opportunity to shape how billions of users connect with content, commerce, and brands worldwide. To learn more, visit &lt;a id=&quot;menur1hur&quot; class=&quot;fui-Link ___1q1shib f2hkw1w f3rmtva f1ewtqcl fyind8e f1k6fduh f1w7gpdv fk6fouc fjoy568 figsok6 f1s184ao f1mk8lai fnbmjn9 f1o700av f13mvf36 f1cmlufx f9n3di6 f1ids18y f1tx3yz7 f1deo86v f1eh06m1 f1iescvh fhgqx19 f1olyrje f1p93eir f1nev41a f1h8hb77 f1lqvz6u f10aw75t fsle3fq f17ae5zn&quot; href=&quot;http://www.inmobi.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;www.inmobi.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Manager - Advertising Platform Strategy - (Google, Meta, TikTok, Bing)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Overview of the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;The best advertising platforms are built by people who have lived the work they are automating. At Accelerate, we are building a platform that abstracts and intelligently operationalises everything a skilled practitioner does across the major walled garden platforms — and to do that credibly, we need someone who has done that work at a high level, for real advertisers, over a sustained period of time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;As Senior Media Buyer, you will be Accelerate&#39;s in-house platform authority — the practitioner voice embedded within the product and engineering organisation. You will bring firsthand expertise in how campaigns are planned, built, managed, and optimised across Google, Meta, TikTok, Snap, and other major platforms, along with a deep understanding of how agencies operationalise this work on behalf of advertisers. You will use that expertise not only to run live campaigns that test and validate Accelerate&#39;s capabilities, but to directly inform the product decisions that determine what gets built and how.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;This is a role for someone who is ready to take everything they have learned from years of active platform work and use it to build something — a product that makes their expertise available to thousands of advertisers who do not yet have it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;You will report directly to the Head of Product, Accelerate, and be embedded within the core product organisation. The role is based in Bengaluru.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr class=&quot;border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Impact You Will Make&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Serve as the Platform Intelligence Authority for Accelerate&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;You will be the definitive internal reference for how the major walled garden platforms function in practice — their structures, their behaviours, their constraints, and the operational realities that experienced practitioners navigate daily but that documentation rarely captures accurately. When the product or engineering team needs to understand how something actually works on a platform, you will be the first and most reliable source of that understanding.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Run Live Campaigns to Test and Validate the Product&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;You will actively manage campaigns across platforms through Accelerate as features are developed and iterated — not as a demonstration exercise, but as a genuine quality mechanism. Your hands-on testing will surface where the product meets the standard set by native platform experiences and where it falls short, generating structured, specific feedback that engineering teams can act on with confidence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Translate Operational Expertise into Product Direction&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;You will convert practitioner knowledge — accumulated through years of active campaign management and agency workflows — into product input that is precise, credible, and actionable. The goal is to ensure that what Accelerate builds reflects how advertisers and agencies actually operate, not how they are assumed to operate based on external research or documentation alone.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bring Agency Workflow Intelligence into the Build&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;A significant portion of digital advertising spend flows through agencies, and the way agencies plan, execute, and report on campaigns for their clients involves operational workflows, approval structures, and platform conventions that are invisible to those who have not worked within them. You will bring that understanding into Accelerate&#39;s product development — ensuring the platform is built with genuine awareness of how agencies work and what they need to operate efficiently on behalf of their clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be a Builder, Not Just a Practitioner&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;The most distinctive aspect of this role is the opportunity to translate your expertise into something that scales beyond what any individual practitioner can do. You will work closely with product and engineering teams to shape how Accelerate encodes platform knowledge, automates complex workflows, and makes sophisticated advertising capability accessible to SMBs and agencies who do not have a team of specialists behind them. Your experience is the raw material. The product is what it becomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr class=&quot;border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Experience We Require&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;4–7 Years of Hands-On Campaign Management Across Major Walled Garden Platforms&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;You have managed live advertising campaigns across Google, Meta, and at least one of TikTok, Snap, or Pinterest — actively, at a practitioner level, over a sustained period. You understand these platforms with the depth that comes from daily operation, not from certification programmes or strategic oversight. Your knowledge of how each platform behaves in practice — including where it is inconsistent with its own documentation — is a core asset you bring to this role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Grounded Understanding of the US Advertising Market&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Your experience is rooted in the context of US-based advertisers and the agencies that serve them. You understand how the US market approaches digital advertising — the priorities, the conventions, the performance standards, and the competitive dynamics that shape how campaigns are built and evaluated. This market fluency is as important as your platform fluency.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deep Familiarity with Agency Operational Workflows&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;You have worked within or in close partnership with agencies managing campaigns on behalf of advertisers, and you understand the operational workflows this involves — how accounts are structured, how work is divided across teams, how reporting and optimisation processes are run, and what the platform-level conventions are that experienced agency practitioners rely on. You understand not just what agencies do, but how and why they do it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Practitioner&#39;s Understanding of What Makes Platforms Work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Beyond executing campaigns, you have developed genuine intuition for why things work the way they do on each platform — what drives performance, what creates friction, where automation helps and where it introduces risk, and what the experience of managing campaigns at scale on native platforms reveals that a first-time user would never see. You bring this understanding as a form of institutional knowledge, not as a checklist of tactics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Comfort Working Within a Product and Engineering Environment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;This role is embedded in a product organisation. You will participate in feature design discussions, translate operational knowledge into structured product requirements, and work iteratively with engineers who may have limited advertising domain knowledge. You communicate precisely, document clearly, and are genuinely motivated by the prospect of making your expertise programmable and scalable through a product.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Intellectual Curiosity and a Builder&#39;s Orientation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;You are drawn to this role not because it is a media buying position, but because it is an opportunity to use media buying expertise to build something consequential. You follow platform changes with genuine interest, you form strong views on what good looks like, and you are motivated by the idea of encoding those views into a product that serves a much larger audience than any individual practitioner could reach directly.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The InMobi Culture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At InMobi, culture isn’t a buzzword; it&#39;s an ethos woven by every InMobian, reflecting our diverse backgrounds and experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We thrive on challenges and seize every opportunity for growth. Our core values — thinking big, being passionate, showing accountability, and taking ownership with freedom — guide us in every decision we make.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in nurturing and investing in your development through continuous learning and career progression with our InMobi Live Your Potential program.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;InMobi is proud to be an Equal Employment Opportunity employer and is committed to providing reasonable accommodations to qualified individuals with disabilities throughout the hiring process and in the workplace.&lt;/p&gt;
