&lt;p data-start=&quot;402&quot; data-end=&quot;658&quot;&gt;We are looking for a high-performing Sales Manager to lead and accelerate our growth in Indonesia. This role is critical to scaling our business, with a clear mandate to 2X revenue and expand market share over the next phase of growth.&lt;/p&gt;
