&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;12,5,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; Deeply understand and implement complex &lt;strong&gt;data sharing and visibility&lt;/strong&gt; models (e.g., territory management) and platform authentication patterns (SSO, OAuth).&lt;/p&gt;
