&lt;h1&gt;Senior Associate – Business Finance&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About the Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;We are looking for a sharp and proactive Senior Associate – Business Finance to join the Business Finance team, supporting revenue operations, planning cycles, and commercial decision-making for the unit. This is a high-exposure role suited for someone who wants to build a strong foundation in commercial finance within a fast-paced ad-tech environment — while also leveraging AI tools and automation to work smarter and drive better decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Business Finance &amp;amp; Partnering&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a trusted finance partner for the business, working closely with product, revenue, and operations teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support planning cycles — prepare monthly accruals, maintain revenue files, and build/update revenue and cost forecasts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze financial trends, identify variances, and recommend actionable interventions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Commercial &amp;amp; Deal Support&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review cost and revenue contracts to identify key commercial terms, flag risks, and suggest improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate deal structures — prepare deal-level P&amp;amp;L templates, run scenario analyses, and check adherence to pricing/margin guidelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own periodic reconciliations between records, contracts, and actuals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;AI &amp;amp; Process Improvement&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI assistants (e.g., ChatGPT, Copilot) to automate reporting, validate data, and build BI dashboards (Power BI/Tableau) for real-time KPI visibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify manual finance workflows and automate using no-code/low-code tools (e.g., Power Automate).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support annual planning with data packs, models, and market research; document workflows for scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CA qualified, or MBA (Finance) from a reputed Tier 1 institute.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2–3 years of experience in Business Finance, FP&amp;amp;A, or commercial finance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong Excel and financial modelling skills; comfort with large datasets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with BI tools (Power BI, Tableau) and AI assistants (ChatGPT, Copilot, Notion AI); exposure to SAP/Oracle/Anaplan or SQL is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sharp analytical thinking with strong attention to detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear written and verbal communication — able to summarize findings crisply.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive, curious, and comfortable operating in ambiguity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Bangalore&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The InMobi Culture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At InMobi, culture isn’t a buzzword; it&#39;s an ethos woven by every InMobian, reflecting our diverse backgrounds and experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We thrive on challenges and seize every opportunity for growth. Our core values — thinking big, being passionate, showing accountability, and taking ownership with freedom — guide us in every decision we make.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in nurturing and investing in your development through continuous learning and career progression with our InMobi Live Your Potential program.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;InMobi is proud to be an Equal Employment Opportunity employer and is committed to providing reasonable accommodations to qualified individuals with disabilities throughout the hiring process and in the workplace.&lt;/p&gt;
