&lt;p data-start=&quot;671&quot; data-end=&quot;1119&quot;&gt;Through Glance AI’s rich first-party data and unparalleled consumer access, it harnesses InMobi’s global scale, insights, and targeting capabilities to create high-impact, performance-driven shopping journeys for brands worldwide. Part of the InMobi Group, a global technology and advertising leader reaching over 2 billion devices and serving more than 30,000 enterprise brands worldwide, Glance AI is backed by Google, Jio Platforms, and Mithril Capital.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Overview of the Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Glance is at an inflection point. With over 250 million daily active users and a platform embedded at the heart of the Android ecosystem, we&#39;re not building for scale — we&#39;re already there. Now, we&#39;re looking for a Group Product Manager to join our U.S. Growth Team and lead where we go next.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is not a conventional PM role. Rather than executing against a pre-built roadmap, you&#39;ll own and shape it — identifying the growth levers, prototyping the ideas, pitching the vision, and driving the kind of orbit-shifting outcomes that move the needle on devices, DAU, and revenue at a global scale. You&#39;ll work at the intersection of product, technology, design, analytics, and business development, often all in the same week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you thrive in ambiguity, move with urgency, and know how to drive outcomes without needing a large team behind you, this role was built for you. Startup DNA is a must. Hustle is non-negotiable.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This role is based onsite in our San Mateo, CA, office and is not open to remote work.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Impact You&#39;ll Make:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own growth end-to-end.&lt;/strong&gt; You will be directly responsible for driving user growth, device growth, and revenue growth for Glance globally, with a clear North Star of getting Glance onto as many devices as possible and meaningfully increasing Daily Active Users.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vibe code your way to fast answers.&lt;/strong&gt; Leverage AI-assisted development and rapid prototyping to independently build and test POCs at the Android or backend layer — validating ideas at speed before handing off to engineering to scale across millions of devices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design high-fidelity mocks that move the room.&lt;/strong&gt; Create concept-ready, high-fidelity mockups used in pitches to OEMs and Telcos or to bring a POC to life. Our full-strength UX design team picks it up from there, and your job is to get it compelling enough to open the door.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be the growth hacker.&lt;/strong&gt; Identify and execute growth opportunities across the Android layer and device/system layer. Work closely with OEMs, Telcos, and system apps baked into the phone to unlock step-change growth in DAU and devices that others don&#39;t even see.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the funnel like a data analyst.&lt;/strong&gt; Dig into activation, engagement, and retention data to uncover where users drop off and where the real opportunity lives. Turn those insights into actionable product changes that compound over time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pitch and close.&lt;/strong&gt; Take new integration concepts, new surfaces, and new partnership models directly to OEMs and Telcos across the globe. You&#39;re part PM, part BD — comfortable presenting to senior stakeholders and walking away with a yes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive agent adoption.&lt;/strong&gt; As Glance deepens its investment in Consumer AI, you&#39;ll play a key role in driving meaningful AI agent usage across the platform, a critical growth frontier for the company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Experience We Need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of consumer product management experience, with a proven track record of building and scaling products that real people use every day.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with vibe coding, AI-assisted development, or rapid prototyping — the ability to spin up a functional POC independently is a genuine differentiator here.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical foundation: you&#39;re comfortable owning funnel analysis, retention modeling, and growth diagnostics without needing a dedicated data team to do it for you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to design high-fidelity product mocks and translate concepts into compelling visual narratives for external pitches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working cross-functionally across tech, design, analytics, GTM, and business development: you know how to drive alignment and momentum across functions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience collaborating with Telcos, OEMs, or system integrators is a significant plus at this level, and familiarity with the Android ecosystem and device-level distribution is highly valued.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Startup background strongly preferred. We&#39;re looking for builders and hustlers, not process managers. FAANG experience alone is unlikely to be the right fit for this environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional communication and executive presence: you can pitch a vision to a Telco partner in Seoul and align an internal engineering team on the same day.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
