&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Our compensation philosophy enables us to provide a competitive salary that drives high performance while balancing business needs and&amp;nbsp;pay&amp;nbsp;parity. We&amp;nbsp;determine&amp;nbsp;compensation on a wide variety of factors, including role, nature of experience, skills, and location.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
