&lt;p data-start=&quot;272&quot; data-end=&quot;669&quot;&gt;Its proprietary models, seamlessly integrated with Google’s most advanced AI platforms, Gemini and Imagen on Vertex AI, deliver hyper-realistic, deeply personal shopping experiences across categories such as fashion, beauty, travel, accessories, home décor, pets, and more. Designed to seamlessly integrate into everyday consumer technology, Glance AI reimagines the future of e-commerce with inspiration-led discovery and shopping.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;671&quot; data-end=&quot;1119&quot;&gt;With an open architecture built for effortless adoption across hardware and software ecosystems, Glance AI is creating a platform that can become a staple in everyday consumer technology. It partners with the world’s leading smartphone makers, connected TV manufacturers, telecom providers, and global brands — meeting people where they are: on mobile, smart TVs, and brand websites.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;671&quot; data-end=&quot;1119&quot;&gt;Through Glance AI’s rich first-party data and unparalleled consumer access, it harnesses InMobi’s global scale, insights, and targeting capabilities to create high-impact, performance-driven shopping journeys for brands worldwide. Part of the InMobi Group, a global technology and advertising leader reaching over 2 billion devices and serving more than 30,000 enterprise brands worldwide, Glance AI is backed by Google, Jio Platforms, and Mithril Capital.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Overview of the Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;The Americas is Glance&#39;s largest and fastest-growing region, and it is expanding quickly across new partners, surfaces, and markets. Getting our products onto devices is only half the job; delivering reliably enough that partners want to expand with us is the other half. This role owns that second half.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:288}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;As &lt;strong&gt;Program Manager, Partner Launches &amp;amp; Delivery&lt;/strong&gt;, you will be the single accountable owner for taking our partner launches from kickoff to go-live — on the committed date, at the committed scope. You will turn a fast-moving roadmap and a room full of stakeholders into one plan, one tracker, and one clear story of what is happening and when. And you will make each launch faster than the last by building the playbook the whole team runs on.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:288}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Impact You&#39;ll Make:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551500&amp;quot;:7153881,&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:431,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:273,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Run the launches. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Be the single accountable owner for each partner launch, end to end: one plan, one tracker, one status&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551500&amp;quot;:7153881,&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:431,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:273,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Hold the scope line.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Define and defend what ships at launch versus what follows. Push back — with data and alternatives — when scope grows late.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551500&amp;quot;:7153881,&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:431,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:273,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Coordinate across functions.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Bring together Product, Engineering, Design, Revenue Operations, Legal and Privacy, Marketing and PR, and the account team. Turn dependencies into named owners and dates.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551500&amp;quot;:7153881,&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:431,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:273,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Partner with our customers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Work alongside the Account Manager as the delivery counterpart to the partner&#39;s program and technical teams, driving integration milestones through to launch readiness.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551500&amp;quot;:7153881,&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:431,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:273,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Surface risk early.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Produce weekly status a senior leader can read in two minutes: what&#39;s on track, what&#39;s at risk, and what decision is needed by when. No surprises in the final weeks.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551500&amp;quot;:7153881,&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:431,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:273,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Own the transition to steady state.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Track post-launch health with the account team — adoption, delivery quality, and open partner commitments — through to a clean handover.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551500&amp;quot;:7153881,&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:431,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:273,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Build the playbook.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Turn each launch into a repeatable operating model — checklist, integration sequence, decision gates — so the second and third launches move faster than the first.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:288}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Experience We Need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551500&amp;quot;:7153881,&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:431,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:273,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;8&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;6+ years in technical program or launch management, ideally in mobile, adtech, consumer applications, or platform software.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551500&amp;quot;:7153881,&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:431,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:273,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;8&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Demonstrated experience shipping with large external partners — carriers, OEMs, platforms, or enterprise customers — where the partner&#39;s dates and standards were non-negotiable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551500&amp;quot;:7153881,&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:431,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:273,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;8&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;A track record of holding scope and dates with senior stakeholders. You can say “that comes later” and make it stick, diplomatically.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551500&amp;quot;:7153881,&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:431,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:273,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;8&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Excellent written communication — status updates concise enough that executives actually read them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551500&amp;quot;:7153881,&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:431,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:273,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;8&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;High tolerance for ambiguity and a fast-moving roadmap. You build the process that&#39;s missing rather than waiting for one.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551500&amp;quot;:7153881,&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:431,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:273,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;8&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Comfort operating across United States and India (Bangalore) time zones, where much of Product and Engineering sits.&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:288}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Nice to have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:340,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:130}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551500&amp;quot;:7153881,&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:431,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:273,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;14&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Direct experience with mobile carriers, OEMs, or their launch and certification processes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551500&amp;quot;:7153881,&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:431,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:273,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;14&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Familiarity with mobile device software, pre-load and firmware integrations, or on-device experiences such as lock screen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551500&amp;quot;:7153881,&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:431,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:273,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;14&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Exposure to ad-supported or subscription billing mechanics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551500&amp;quot;:7153881,&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:431,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:273,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;14&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Experience standing up a launch or program function from scratch, not only operating inside an established one.&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:288}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Why Glance?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551500&amp;quot;:7153881,&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:431,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:273,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;18&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Category creation, not incremental work. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Agentic commerce is being defined right now, and our partner launches are how it reaches millions of consumers. You&#39;ll own the delivery engine behind that.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551500&amp;quot;:7153881,&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:431,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:273,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;18&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;The role that makes growth real.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Great strategy dies in delivery. You are the person who makes sure what we promise partners actually ships — the difference between winning an account and keeping it.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551500&amp;quot;:7153881,&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:431,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:273,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;18&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Structural backing without big-company friction.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;The scale and infrastructure of the InMobi Group, with the latitude and pace of a team still writing its own playbook.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551500&amp;quot;:7153881,&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:431,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:273,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;18&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Visible, high-stakes work.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Our launches are revenue events and often joint public moments with the partner. Your work is seen — inside the company and across the industry.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
