&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Glance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;is a place where everyone can grow.&amp;nbsp;Howsoever&amp;nbsp;you&amp;nbsp;identify, and whatever background you bring with you, we invite you to apply if this sounds like a role that would make you excited to work. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;InMobi&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Glance&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants for employment and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type.  All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin,&amp;nbsp;disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state, or local laws. This policy applies to all terms and conditions of employment, including recruiting, hiring, placement, promotion, termination, layoff, recall, transfer, leaves of absence, compensation, and training. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ui-provider ee bcu auz bcv bcw bcx bcy bcz bda bdb bdc bdd bde bdf bdg bdh bdi bdj bdk bdl bdm bdn bdo bdp bdq bdr bds bdt bdu bdv bdw bdx bdy bdz bea&quot;&gt;&quot;&lt;em&gt;Glance collects and processes personal data such as your name, contact details, resume and other information that may contain personal data for the purpose of processing your application. Glance utilizes Greenhouse, a third-party platform. Please review Greenhouse&#39;s Privacy Policy to understand how the data collected from you is processed and managed. By clicking on &#39;Submit Application&#39;, you acknowledge and agree to the above privacy terms. Should you have any privacy concerns, you may contact us through the details mentioned in your application confirmation email.&quot;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;272&quot; data-end=&quot;669&quot;&gt;Glance AI is an AI commerce platform shaping the next wave of e-commerce with inspiration-led shopping, less about searching for what you want and more about discovering who you could be. Operating in 140 countries, Glance AI transforms every screen into a stage for instant, personal, and joyful discovery, where inspiration becomes something you can explore, feel, and shop in the moment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;272&quot; data-end=&quot;669&quot;&gt;Its proprietary models, seamlessly integrated with Google’s most advanced AI platforms, Gemini and Imagen on Vertex AI, deliver hyper-realistic, deeply personal shopping experiences across categories such as fashion, beauty, travel, accessories, home décor, pets, and more. Designed to seamlessly integrate into everyday consumer technology, Glance AI reimagines the future of e-commerce with inspiration-led discovery and shopping.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;671&quot; data-end=&quot;1119&quot;&gt;With an open architecture built for effortless adoption across hardware and software ecosystems, Glance AI is creating a platform that can become a staple in everyday consumer technology. It partners with the world’s leading smartphone makers, connected TV manufacturers, telecom providers, and global brands — meeting people where they are: on mobile, smart TVs, and brand websites.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;671&quot; data-end=&quot;1119&quot;&gt;Through Glance AI’s rich first-party data and unparalleled consumer access, it harnesses InMobi’s global scale, insights, and targeting capabilities to create high-impact, performance-driven shopping journeys for brands worldwide. Part of the InMobi Group, a global technology and advertising leader reaching over 2 billion devices and serving more than 30,000 enterprise brands worldwide, Glance AI is backed by Google, Jio Platforms, and Mithril Capital.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;This role will lead content strategy and operations across Glance Home Lock (HL), Spaces, and Expressions, including content curation, design management, publisher partnerships,&amp;nbsp;distribution&amp;nbsp;stakeholders. The individual will work closely with HQ to drive publishing automation, analyze performance metrics to optimize the content mix,&amp;nbsp;collaborate with external publishers to source and scale high-quality content, present&amp;nbsp;content&amp;nbsp;data/metrics&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;our&amp;nbsp;distribution&amp;nbsp;(SBKK/Sharp/…)&amp;nbsp;stakeholders.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Become well-versed in AI automation and content creation tools, with a focus on producing high volumes of quality content in alignment with content strategies&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Adhere to publishing schedules to maintain regularity and quality of content&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Digest direction from internal stakeholders (direct managers) on the overall content plan and direction, and serve as a reliable mentor to junior editors&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Lead end-to-end project management across multiple content assignments and deliverables — planning timelines, allocating resources, tracking progress, and ensuring on-time, on-quality delivery in daily operations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Proactively identify bottlenecks and risks in content production workflows, and drive process improvements to increase efficiency and scalability&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Work cross-market and cross-functionally, coordinating stakeholders and dependencies to keep projects on track&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Collaborate smoothly with the design team to ensure market-suited, aesthetically appropriate design in line with design guidelines&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Take strong ownership of the product, with a clear sense of responsibility for maintaining quality content across the product&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Able to analyze data, identify growth opportunities, and quickly run improvement cycles together with team members&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;More than 5 years of experience, with native-level proficiency in Japanese. English is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong project management mindset, with demonstrated experience managing multiple concurrent projects, timelines, and cross-functional stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong interest in digital content and trends&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Aware of the importance of deadlines and adherence to content regulations/guidelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passionate about working in a fast-paced, ever-changing environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A team player with exceptional communication and interpersonal skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive in addressing issues as they arise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understands the value of partnership and can work collaboratively on projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experienced in working with designers and outsourcing partners is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experienced in content automation and AIGC (AI-generated content) creation is a plus&lt;hr&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ui-provider ee bcu auz bcv bcw bcx bcy bcz bda bdb bdc bdd bde bdf bdg bdh bdi bdj bdk bdl bdm bdn bdo bdp bdq bdr bds bdt bdu bdv bdw bdx bdy bdz bea&quot;&gt;&quot;&lt;em&gt;Glance collects and processes personal data such as your name, contact details, resume and other information that may contain personal data for the purpose of processing your application. Glance utilizes Greenhouse, a third-party platform. Please review Greenhouse&#39;s Privacy Policy to understand how the data collected from you is processed and managed. By clicking on &#39;Submit Application&#39;, you acknowledge and agree to the above privacy terms. Should you have any privacy concerns, you may contact us through the details mentioned in your application confirmation email.&quot;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

