&lt;div class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;Glance is looking for a Senior Manager, Brand &amp;amp; Consumer Marketing to lead our brand and consumer marketing efforts in Japan.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;In this role, you will be responsible for shaping how Glance is introduced, understood, and adopted by Japanese consumers. Working closely with local, regional, and global stakeholders, you will lead brand campaigns, creator and influencer partnerships, consumer storytelling, and growth initiatives that build awareness, trust, and engagement.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;This is an exciting opportunity for a marketer who combines strong local market expertise with a passion for culture, technology, and consumer behavior, and who wants to help build the future of AI-powered shopping experiences in Japan.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Localize the Brand for Japan&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;Adapt and evolve Glance&#39;s global brand positioning for Japanese consumers across fashion, beauty, lifestyle, entertainment, and technology categories. Ensure all communications feel locally relevant and culturally authentic.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead Brand and Partnership Campaigns&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;Develop and execute integrated marketing campaigns across digital, social, PR, influencer, and experiential channels. Drive awareness, consideration, and engagement through strategic partnerships and culturally relevant activations.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build the Creator and Influencer Ecosystem&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;Develop relationships with creators, influencers, talent agencies, media partners, and cultural tastemakers. Create long-term collaboration programs that strengthen brand credibility and consumer trust.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Consumer Storytelling&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;Develop compelling narratives across earned, owned, paid, and social channels. Ensure a consistent brand voice while tailoring content and messaging for Japanese audiences.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own Social and Cultural Relevance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;Stay closely connected to Japanese consumer trends, internet culture, social platforms, and emerging communities. Identify opportunities for Glance to participate in relevant conversations and cultural moments.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Consumer Growth &amp;amp; Adoption&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;Partner with Growth, Product Marketing, and Performance Marketing teams to drive user acquisition, engagement, and retention. Ensure brand investments contribute to measurable business outcomes and consumer adoption.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Measure Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;Define and track key performance indicators across awareness, consideration, engagement, sentiment, acquisition, retention, and brand health. Use data and consumer insights to continuously improve performance.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate Cross-Functionally&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;Work closely with Product Marketing, Creative, PR, Social, Growth, Business Development, and Global Marketing teams to deliver high-quality execution. Support the development and growth of the local marketing function over time.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of experience in brand, consumer, or integrated marketing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience building brands, products, or consumer businesses in Japan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of Japanese consumer culture, social platforms, media landscape, and creator ecosystem&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing and executing integrated marketing campaigns across earned, owned, and paid channels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of influencer marketing, creator partnerships, and community building&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of performance marketing, including paid social, search, creator amplification, app growth, and attribution frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to balance long-term brand building with measurable business objectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills and experience using insights to inform marketing strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent stakeholder management and cross-functional collaboration skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working in a fast-paced, high-growth environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Entrepreneurial mindset with a willingness to be hands-on&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Native-level Japanese and business-level English required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Glance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help build one of the world&#39;s leading agentic commerce platforms in one of its most important growth markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work at the intersection of AI, shopping, culture, and creativity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Play a key role in shaping how Japanese consumers discover products, inspiration, and new experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;Collaborate with talented colleagues across Japan, U.S and India&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Build and scale a category-defining brand from an early stage&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ui-provider ee bcu auz bcv bcw bcx bcy bcz bda bdb bdc bdd bde bdf bdg bdh bdi bdj bdk bdl bdm bdn bdo bdp bdq bdr bds bdt bdu bdv bdw bdx bdy bdz bea&quot;&gt;&quot;&lt;em&gt;Glance collects and processes personal data such as your name, contact details, resume and other information that may contain personal data for the purpose of processing your application. Glance utilizes Greenhouse, a third-party platform. Please review Greenhouse&#39;s Privacy Policy to understand how the data collected from you is processed and managed. By clicking on &#39;Submit Application&#39;, you acknowledge and agree to the above privacy terms. Should you have any privacy concerns, you may contact us through the details mentioned in your application confirmation email.&quot;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;272&quot; data-end=&quot;669&quot;&gt;Glance AI is an AI commerce platform shaping the next wave of e-commerce with inspiration-led shopping, less about searching for what you want and more about discovering who you could be. Operating in 140 countries, Glance AI transforms every screen into a stage for instant, personal, and joyful discovery, where inspiration becomes something you can explore, feel, and shop in the moment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;272&quot; data-end=&quot;669&quot;&gt;Its proprietary models, seamlessly integrated with Google’s most advanced AI platforms, Gemini and Imagen on Vertex AI, deliver hyper-realistic, deeply personal shopping experiences across categories such as fashion, beauty, travel, accessories, home décor, pets, and more. Designed to seamlessly integrate into everyday consumer technology, Glance AI reimagines the future of e-commerce with inspiration-led discovery and shopping.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;671&quot; data-end=&quot;1119&quot;&gt;With an open architecture built for effortless adoption across hardware and software ecosystems, Glance AI is creating a platform that can become a staple in everyday consumer technology. It partners with the world’s leading smartphone makers, connected TV manufacturers, telecom providers, and global brands — meeting people where they are: on mobile, smart TVs, and brand websites.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;671&quot; data-end=&quot;1119&quot;&gt;Through Glance AI’s rich first-party data and unparalleled consumer access, it harnesses InMobi’s global scale, insights, and targeting capabilities to create high-impact, performance-driven shopping journeys for brands worldwide. Part of the InMobi Group, a global technology and advertising leader reaching over 2 billion devices and serving more than 30,000 enterprise brands worldwide, Glance AI is backed by Google, Jio Platforms, and Mithril Capital.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Overview of the Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Glance, we&#39;re not just changing how people shop — we&#39;re redefining what shopping even means. We&#39;re building agentic commerce from the ground up, and we&#39;re looking for an entrepreneurial, high-energy Senior Manager of Channel Sales &amp;amp; Partnerships to lead our growth across the U.S. retail landscape.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is about more than business development. It&#39;s about championing a genuinely new category, AI Commerce, and bringing the most exciting brands in fashion, beauty, and accessories along for the ride. You&#39;ll be on the front lines of introducing predictive intelligence, neural visualization, and real-time orchestration to premium and mid-market U.S. retailers, helping them create seamless, shoppable experiences their customers haven&#39;t seen before.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a key member of our U.S. leadership team, you&#39;ll operate with real ownership, real speed, and real impact. If you&#39;ve built deep retail relationships, know how to open doors and close deals, and want to do it at a company that reaches 200M+ people daily, this is the role for you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Impact You&#39;ll Make:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive AI Commerce Adoption&lt;/strong&gt;: Build strategic 1:1 partnerships with premium and mid-market U.S. retail brands across fashion, beauty, and accessories. Expand our network of 400+ global partners by integrating AI Commerce into their ecosystems, positioning Glance AI as the definitive platform for next-generation retail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead Strategic Outreach &amp;amp; Merchant Onboarding&lt;/strong&gt;: Identify, target, and onboard high-value retailers and brands with precision. You&#39;ll own the full lifecycle, from first conversation to seamless integration, nurturing long-term, trust-based relationships that maximize partner success on the platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advocate for Retailer Needs&lt;/strong&gt;: Serve as the voice of the merchant internally, representing partner priorities to product and partner marketing teams. Your insights will directly shape how Glance AI evolves to meet the realities of the U.S. retail market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accelerate Revenue Growth&lt;/strong&gt;: Develop and execute a partnership strategy that secures exclusive collaborations, drives transaction volume, and demonstrates the unique value of AI Commerce to retailers who are ready to lead, not follow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape U.S. Market Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;: Lead Glance&#39;s U.S. expansion by tailoring AI Commerce solutions to the needs of American retailers and consumers. You&#39;ll be competing against the biggest names in social commerce — Meta, Snapchat, and others — and winning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovate Alongside Our AI Teams&lt;/strong&gt;: Partner directly with our product and AI teams to continuously enhance our commerce intelligence and experience models. Real-time feedback from your partners will fuel innovations that keep Glance AI at the forefront of AI-driven retail globally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scale Glance AI Across Categories&lt;/strong&gt;: Lead the expansion of our partnerships into beauty, accessories, and travel, establishing Glance AI&#39;s leadership across the full U.S. retail market as this once-in-a-generation shift to AI Commerce accelerates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Experience We Need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience&lt;/strong&gt;: 10+ years in merchandising, marketplace development, or retail business development, with a proven track record in merchant acquisition or vendor onboarding at premium or mid-market retail organizations. Think Nordstrom, Bloomingdale&#39;s, Saks, Farfetch, Revolve, or marketplace teams at Amazon Fashion, TikTok Shop, or equivalent platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Network&lt;/strong&gt;: A robust, trusted network of brand contacts across fashion, beauty, and accessories. You know the right people, and more importantly, they know and respect you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education&lt;/strong&gt;: a Master&#39;s degree in Business Administration preferred; Marketing or a related field accepted.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills &amp;amp; Attributes:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional communicator and negotiator: you build real relationships, not just contact lists&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep fluency in e-commerce trends, technologies, and best practices across premium and mid-market retail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic thinker with a results-driven mindset who thrives in fast-moving, ambiguous environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytically sharp: you know how to read data, extract the signal, and translate it into action&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Natural bridge-builder who can convert retailer feedback into clear, actionable product and marketing insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong cross-functional leader who can motivate and align global teams around high-impact initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Genuinely entrepreneurial: you&#39;re energized by building something new, not maintaining something old&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Build…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Glance, we’re building products that are redefining industries. Our ecosystem spans:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Glance&lt;/strong&gt; – A revolutionary Gen AI-powered lockscreen &amp;amp; TV content platform transforming how millions discover and engage with content&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;InMobi Advertising&lt;/strong&gt; – Powering data-driven mobile marketing for the world’s leading brands&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1Weather&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;– One of the world’s leading weather platforms, delivering precise, reliable, and real-time weather forecasts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With deep expertise in AI, mobile, consumer technology, and digital innovation, we are home to some of the brightest minds in the industry.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What sets us apart? Not just what we build. How we build it. At Glance, we balance our hunger for cutting-edge tech with a deep focus on our people - their growth, well-being, and potential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;At Glance, you’ll be surrounded by people who…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Think big and act fast:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We’re entrepreneurial, thrive in ambiguity, and love solving high-impact problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are passionate, fanatically driven, and take immense pride in their work:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We care deeply about the impact we create and continuously push our potential&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own their outcomes:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We take responsibility, make bold decisions, and execute with confidence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Embrace freedom with accountability:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We value autonomy and understand that trust comes with responsibility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Believe in lifelong learning:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We welcome feedback, challenge ourselves to grow, and aren’t afraid to take smart risks&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;annotation text&quot;&gt;Award-winning culture, best-in-class benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;annotation text&quot;&gt;Our compensation philosophy enables us to provide a competitive salary that drives high performance while balancing business needs and pay parity. We&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;annotation text&quot;&gt;determine&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;annotation text&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;compensation based on a wide variety of factors, including role, nature of experience,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;annotation text&quot;&gt;skills,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;annotation text&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;and location.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;The base salary (fixed) pay range for this role is&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt; $139,500 to $184,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(224, 62, 45);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;(min to max of base salary pay). This salary range is applicable to our offices located in California and New York&lt;strong&gt;*&lt;/strong&gt;. In addition, Glance employees may also receive variable pay in the form of an annual variable bonus or quarterly variable bonus/sales incentive, as deemed per policy, in addition to fixed compensation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;*Our ranges may vary based on the final location or region of the roles in accordance with the geographical differentiation in pay scales in the country.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition to cash compensation, based on the position, a Glancer can receive equity in the form of Restricted Stock Units (RSUs). We believe that our employees/personnel should have the ability to own a part of the entity they are a part of. Therefore, the entity employing you may elect to provide such stocks to you. Ownership of stock enables us to treat our employer company as our own and base our decisions on the company’s best interest at heart. To encourage a spirit of shared ownership, we grant Glancers relevant company stock(s). As you contribute to the growth of your company, certain stocks may be issued to you in recognition of your contribution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A quick snapshot of our U.S. benefits:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary and RSU grant (where applicable)&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High-quality medical, dental, and vision insurance (including company-matched HSA)&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;401(k) company match&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous combination of vacation time, sick days, special occasion time, and company-wide holidays &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Substantial maternity and paternity leave benefits and a compassionate work environment&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours to suit everyone&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wellness stipend for a healthier you!&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free lunch is provided in our offices daily&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pet-friendly work environment and robust pet insurance policy - because we love our animals!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Assistance Program (EAP)&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If this sounds like the kind of team, role, values, benefits, and challenges that excite you, we’d love to hear from you.&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Go for it!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;InMobi / Glance is an equal opportunity employer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;InMobi / Glance is a place where everyone can grow. Howsoever you identify, and whatever background you bring with you, we invite you to apply if this sounds like a role that would make you excited to work.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
