&lt;li&gt;Established senior relationships with brands/merchants in key categories (fashion, beauty, electronics, travel, consumer goods)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mobile, advertising, or commerce-tech experience, ideally at high-growth scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Glance AI&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ownership.&lt;/strong&gt; You will not be confined to one category or one type of partner. You operate where you can also build a portfolio that is genuinely yours.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Structural backing without big-company friction.&lt;/strong&gt; Glance is part of InMobi Group with proven scale (Glance reaches 400M+ monthly users globally) and infrastructure already built, but JP operates as a startup with founding-team on strategy and deals. Backed by strong global investors including SoftBank and Google, with SoftBank as anchor partner in Japan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A first-team seat in Japan.&lt;/strong&gt; The JP strategy is being written now. The partner playbook and deal architecture that will be replicated across other markets such as Korea, Germany, UK, Australia &amp;nbsp;in the future.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Real category creation, not incremental work.&lt;/strong&gt; Work on genuinely new, AI-first agentic commerce — built from the ground up, not an improvement on today&#39;s shopping&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Culture.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Work with smart, humble people who value openness, trust, and honest collaboration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Competitive salary and benefits:&lt;/strong&gt; Benchmarked against roles at comparable global tech in Tokyo, meaningful equity grant, annual performance bonus tied to outcomes, plus full health, retirement, and standard Japan-market benefits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
