&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;272&quot; data-end=&quot;669&quot;&gt;Glance AI is an AI commerce platform shaping the next wave of e-commerce with inspiration-led shopping, less about searching for what you want and more about discovering who you could be. Operating in 140 countries, Glance AI transforms every screen into a stage for instant, personal, and joyful discovery, where inspiration becomes something you can explore, feel, and shop in the moment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;272&quot; data-end=&quot;669&quot;&gt;Its proprietary models, seamlessly integrated with Google’s most advanced AI platforms, Gemini and Imagen on Vertex AI, deliver hyper-realistic, deeply personal shopping experiences across categories such as fashion, beauty, travel, accessories, home décor, pets, and more. Designed to seamlessly integrate into everyday consumer technology, Glance AI reimagines the future of e-commerce with inspiration-led discovery and shopping.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;671&quot; data-end=&quot;1119&quot;&gt;With an open architecture built for effortless adoption across hardware and software ecosystems, Glance AI is creating a platform that can become a staple in everyday consumer technology. It partners with the world’s leading smartphone makers, connected TV manufacturers, telecom providers, and global brands — meeting people where they are: on mobile, smart TVs, and brand websites.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;671&quot; data-end=&quot;1119&quot;&gt;Through Glance AI’s rich first-party data and unparalleled consumer access, it harnesses InMobi’s global scale, insights, and targeting capabilities to create high-impact, performance-driven shopping journeys for brands worldwide. Part of the InMobi Group, a global technology and advertising leader reaching over 2 billion devices and serving more than 30,000 enterprise brands worldwide, Glance AI is backed by Google, Jio Platforms, and Mithril Capital.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;About the Role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;The Senior Manager, Distribution Partnerships and Business Development, is a cross-cutting senior IC operating across the full Glance AI Japan distribution surface — Retail and franchise, super-app and widget, and Smart TV-OS. &amp;nbsp;The role is built for someone who wants both: the strategic surface area of cross-vector exposure, and the satisfaction of carrying their own deals from first contact through to launch. You will sit at the centre of how Glance reaches Japanese consumers — across every surface where distribution happens.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What will you be doing?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Anchor-deal execution support&lt;/strong&gt; —Retail, super-app, and TV-OS deals; pick up active negotiations, build proposals, manage diligence, move deals through the funnel&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Direct ownership of partnerships&lt;/strong&gt; — carry your own portfolio of partner relationships end-to-end, from sourcing through launch&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial analysis&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;— build the deal models &amp;nbsp;that determine which deals are pursued and on what terms&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner discovery and prioritization&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;— surface new partner opportunities across the full distribution surface, build prioritization frameworks, and maintain the active pipeline&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner-facing senior presence&lt;/strong&gt; — represent Glance in partner meetings; represent Glance in relevant Industry forums and conferences&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Internal coordination and reporting&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;— work cross-functionally with product, integration engineering, legal, finance, and marketing to move deals through the funnel; escalate blockers with proposed solutions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Key Requirements:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;7–10 years in business development, distribution partnerships, or commercial roles in Japan within mobile, internet, advertising, retail/consumer tech, or media&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Track record of carrying at least one or two deals end-to-end yourself, from first contact through to launch&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Business-level Japanese and English — able to operate in Japanese partner meetings and translate context for global counterparts in English&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Comfort operating from a Tokyo-based country team with significant autonomy&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;High tolerance for ambiguity — Glance AI Japan is in early market entry, and several assumptions in the distribution thesis are still being validated; you will need to operate confidently while being open to adjust direction when needed&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Preferred Requirements:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Understanding of Japan&#39;s consumer surface economics: app store and super-app dynamics, retail co-marketing, points/loyalty rails, and TV-OS commercial models&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience launching new consumer surfaces or distribution channels in Japan from zero to early scale&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;MBA, ex-consulting, or ex-investment-banking background&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Glance AI&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A senior seat with real surface area.&lt;/strong&gt; You will not be confined to one category or one type of partner. You operate where you can also build a portfolio that is genuinely yours.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Structural backing without big-company friction.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Glance is part of InMobi Group with proven scale (Glance reaches 400M+ monthly users globally) and infrastructure already built, but JP operates as a startup with founding-team latitude on strategy and deals.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A first-team seat in Japan.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;The JP distribution strategy is being written now. The senior IC operating alongside the first Directors helps shape the partner playbook and deal architecture that will be replicated across other markets such as US, Germany, UK, Australia, and Korea in the future.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Real category creation, not incremental work.&lt;/strong&gt; Japan&#39;s agentic AI distribution layer doesn&#39;t exist yet. You are not optimizing a known channel — you are part of building the playbook that defines how this category reaches Japanese consumers for decades to come.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Competitive salary and benefits:&lt;/strong&gt; Base benchmarked against comparable global tech in Tokyo, meaningful equity grant, annual performance bonus tied to distribution outcomes, plus full health, retirement, and standard Japan-market benefits.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ui-provider ee bcu auz bcv bcw bcx bcy bcz bda bdb bdc bdd bde bdf bdg bdh bdi bdj bdk bdl bdm bdn bdo bdp bdq bdr bds bdt bdu bdv bdw bdx bdy bdz bea&quot;&gt;&quot;&lt;em&gt;Glance collects and processes personal data such as your name, contact details, resume and other information that may contain personal data for the purpose of processing your application. Glance utilizes Greenhouse, a third-party platform. Please review Greenhouse&#39;s Privacy Policy to understand how the data collected from you is processed and managed. By clicking on &#39;Submit Application&#39;, you acknowledge and agree to the above privacy terms. Should you have any privacy concerns, you may contact us through the details mentioned in your application confirmation email.&quot;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;272&quot; data-end=&quot;669&quot;&gt;Glance AI is an AI commerce platform shaping the next wave of e-commerce with inspiration-led shopping, less about searching for what you want and more about discovering who you could be. Operating in 140 countries, Glance AI transforms every screen into a stage for instant, personal, and joyful discovery, where inspiration becomes something you can explore, feel, and shop in the moment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;272&quot; data-end=&quot;669&quot;&gt;Its proprietary models, seamlessly integrated with Google’s most advanced AI platforms, Gemini and Imagen on Vertex AI, deliver hyper-realistic, deeply personal shopping experiences across categories such as fashion, beauty, travel, accessories, home décor, pets, and more. Designed to seamlessly integrate into everyday consumer technology, Glance AI reimagines the future of e-commerce with inspiration-led discovery and shopping.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;671&quot; data-end=&quot;1119&quot;&gt;With an open architecture built for effortless adoption across hardware and software ecosystems, Glance AI is creating a platform that can become a staple in everyday consumer technology. It partners with the world’s leading smartphone makers, connected TV manufacturers, telecom providers, and global brands — meeting people where they are: on mobile, smart TVs, and brand websites.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;671&quot; data-end=&quot;1119&quot;&gt;Through Glance AI’s rich first-party data and unparalleled consumer access, it harnesses InMobi’s global scale, insights, and targeting capabilities to create high-impact, performance-driven shopping journeys for brands worldwide. Part of the InMobi Group, a global technology and advertising leader reaching over 2 billion devices and serving more than 30,000 enterprise brands worldwide, Glance AI is backed by Google, Jio Platforms, and Mithril Capital.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Overview of the Role:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Search changed how we found information. Social changed how we discovered. Intelligent agents are the next shift...and perhaps the biggest one yet.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Instead of searching for products, consumers will have an intelligent shopping agent that understands their taste, their context, and what they&#39;re in the mood for. It won&#39;t just recommend products — it will show them on you, in your home, and in your life, before you buy. The color you didn&#39;t know was yours. A home styled to your personality. Yourself on the trip before you&#39;ve even packed. The guesswork that has always made shopping hard simply disappears, as discovery, inspiration, and purchase become one seamless experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This isn&#39;t a traditional brand marketing role. It&#39;s an opportunity to define an entirely new category and help build the consumer brand introducing agentic shopping to millions of people across the U.S. Few marketers get the chance to shape an entirely new consumer behavior — this is one of them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As our &lt;strong&gt;Senior Manager — Integrated Consumer Marketing&lt;/strong&gt;, you&#39;ll lead integrated marketing programs that build awareness, create cultural relevance, and accelerate the adoption of agentic shopping across the U.S. You&#39;ll play a key role in transforming breakthrough AI into consumer experiences, compelling stories, and cultural moments that make Glance a brand consumers know, trust, and love.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll partner closely with Creative, Social &amp;amp; Content, Consumer PR, Partner Marketing, Consumer Insights, Growth, Product Marketing, Strategy &amp;amp; Operations, and external agencies to bring Glance to life through integrated campaigns, creator programs, strategic partnerships, earned storytelling, cultural moments, and immersive consumer experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for marketers who understand that consumers don&#39;t fall in love with technology — they fall in love with what technology makes possible. Success in this role means translating breakthrough AI into intuitive consumer experiences, compelling stories, and cultural moments that people genuinely want to be part of.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your success won&#39;t be measured by the number of campaigns you launch. It will be measured by your ability to shape consumer behavior, build cultural relevance, and make Glance a brand consumers talk about, creators want to partner with, media wants to cover, and millions of people recognize as a new way to shop.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;The Impact You&#39;ll Make:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Define a New Category&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help establish Glance as the U.S. consumer brand for agentic shopping, driving the marketing programs that build awareness, trust, and adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help shape the consumer behaviors that define the next era of shopping.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the U.S. consumer marketing calendar, aligning product launches, cultural moments, creator programs, partnerships, and campaigns into one integrated roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build Cultural Relevance &amp;amp; Earned Storytelling&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create marketing that people want to participate in, not simply campaigns they see, across fashion, sports, entertainment, retail, creators, technology, and emerging cultural moments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Social &amp;amp; Content and Consumer PR to grow creator programs, engaged consumer communities, and earned-first narratives that establish Glance as a new way to shop.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create experiences consumers want to experience, creators want to share, and media wants to cover — building programs that drive earned media, creator advocacy, and lasting conversation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bring Agentic Shopping to Life&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the Global Consumer Marketing team to localize and bring integrated consumer campaigns to life across paid, earned, owned, creator, experiential, social, and partner channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop immersive consumer experiences that make agentic shopping tangible, intuitive, and desirable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure every consumer touchpoint delivers a seamless, premium Glance brand experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Grow Through Partnerships&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the Partner Marketing team to develop co-marketing programs with OEMs, carriers, retailers, fashion brands, creators, and strategic partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring partnerships to life through integrated campaigns, consumer experiences, and cultural activations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify new partnership opportunities that expand Glance&#39;s reach, strengthen the brand, and accelerate consumer adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Turn Insight Into Growth&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Consumer Insights and Strategy &amp;amp; Operations to understand consumer behavior, measure brand health, and evaluate marketing effectiveness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate consumer insights into marketing strategies, creative ideas, and measurable business impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion a test-and-learn culture — continuously experimenting with new ideas, formats, creators, and partnerships, while optimizing campaigns through research and performance data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead Cross-Functionally&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead through influence across the full range of teams and agencies named above, delivering world-class consumer marketing programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own day-to-day relationships with creative, PR, social, experiential, influencer, and production agencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help develop annual marketing plans, manage campaign budgets, and prioritize investments across campaigns, creators, partnerships, and cultural moments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operate with a builder mindset — moving quickly, embracing ambiguity, and helping define how consumer marketing works inside a category-defining company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;The Experience We Need:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7–10 years of experience in consumer brand marketing, integrated marketing, or consumer marketing within a high-growth consumer technology, retail, lifestyle, entertainment, or media company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience leading integrated consumer marketing campaigns across paid, owned, earned, creator, experiential, partnership, retail, and social channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of U.S. consumer behavior, culture, creators, and emerging trends.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A deep curiosity for emerging technologies, with a proven ability to translate breakthrough innovation into intuitive, compelling consumer experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building creator programs, strategic partnerships, experiential activations, and earned-first marketing initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to influence cross-functional teams and stakeholders without direct authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong strategic thinking paired with exceptional execution and operational excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing agencies, budgets, and multiple workstreams simultaneously.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outstanding communication, storytelling, and presentation skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable operating in a fast-paced, entrepreneurial environment with a high degree of ambiguity and a bias for action.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
