&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ui-provider ee bcu auz bcv bcw bcx bcy bcz bda bdb bdc bdd bde bdf bdg bdh bdi bdj bdk bdl bdm bdn bdo bdp bdq bdr bds bdt bdu bdv bdw bdx bdy bdz bea&quot;&gt;&quot;&lt;em&gt;Glance collects and processes personal data such as your name, contact details, resume and other information that may contain personal data for the purpose of processing your application. Glance utilizes Greenhouse, a third-party platform. Please review Greenhouse&#39;s Privacy Policy to understand how the data collected from you is processed and managed. By clicking on &#39;Submit Application&#39;, you acknowledge and agree to the above privacy terms. Should you have any privacy concerns, you may contact us through the details mentioned in your application confirmation email.&quot;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;272&quot; data-end=&quot;669&quot;&gt;Glance AI is an AI commerce platform shaping the next wave of e-commerce with inspiration-led shopping, less about searching for what you want and more about discovering who you could be. Operating in 140 countries, Glance AI transforms every screen into a stage for instant, personal, and joyful discovery, where inspiration becomes something you can explore, feel, and shop in the moment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;272&quot; data-end=&quot;669&quot;&gt;Its proprietary models, seamlessly integrated with Google’s most advanced AI platforms, Gemini and Imagen on Vertex AI, deliver hyper-realistic, deeply personal shopping experiences across categories such as fashion, beauty, travel, accessories, home décor, pets, and more. Designed to seamlessly integrate into everyday consumer technology, Glance AI reimagines the future of e-commerce with inspiration-led discovery and shopping.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;671&quot; data-end=&quot;1119&quot;&gt;With an open architecture built for effortless adoption across hardware and software ecosystems, Glance AI is creating a platform that can become a staple in everyday consumer technology. It partners with the world’s leading smartphone makers, connected TV manufacturers, telecom providers, and global brands — meeting people where they are: on mobile, smart TVs, and brand websites.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;671&quot; data-end=&quot;1119&quot;&gt;Through Glance AI’s rich first-party data and unparalleled consumer access, it harnesses InMobi’s global scale, insights, and targeting capabilities to create high-impact, performance-driven shopping journeys for brands worldwide. Part of the InMobi Group, a global technology and advertising leader reaching over 2 billion devices and serving more than 30,000 enterprise brands worldwide, Glance AI is backed by Google, Jio Platforms, and Mithril Capital.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Glance AI · Tokyo&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Reporting to the General Manager, Glance AI&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;About the Team&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Glance AI is an AI commerce platform shaping the next wave of e-commerce with inspiration-led shopping, less about searching for what you want and more about discovering who you could be. Operating in 140 countries, Glance AI transforms every screen into a stage for instant, personal, and joyful discovery, where inspiration becomes something you can explore, feel, and shop in the moment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Its proprietary models, seamlessly integrated with Google’s most advanced AI platforms, Gemini and Imagen on Vertex AI, deliver hyper-realistic, deeply personal shopping experiences across categories such as fashion, beauty, travel, accessories, home décor, pets, and more. Designed to seamlessly integrate into everyday consumer technology, Glance AI reimagines the future of e-commerce with inspiration-led discovery and shopping.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With an open architecture built for effortless adoption across hardware and software ecosystems, Glance AI is creating a platform that can become a staple in everyday consumer technology. It partners with the world’s leading smartphone makers, connected TV manufacturers, telecom providers, and global brands — meeting people where they are: on mobile, smart TVs, and brand websites.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Through Glance AI’s rich first-party data and unparalleled consumer access, it harnesses InMobi’s global scale, insights, and targeting capabilities to create high-impact, performance-driven shopping journeys for brands worldwide. Part of the InMobi Group (backed by Softbank), a global technology and advertising leader reaching over 2 billion devices and serving more than 30,000 enterprise brands worldwide, Glance AI is backed by Google, Jio Platforms, and Mithril Capital.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;About the Role&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Head of Strategy and Operations is a Tokyo-based, individual contributor role designed to be the GM’s force multiplier on the ground in Japan. It exists to convert ambition into structured execution: framing the highest-leverage strategic problems, driving a portfolio of critical workstreams from problem-definition through closure, and stepping in as the GM’s proxy in partner and counterpart forums where the GM cannot personally be present.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hands-on role involving problem structuring, drawing the materials, sitting in the partner meetings, and structuring the deals. Coordinating into Glance’s BD, product, commercial, and corporate development functions as the work requires, and aligning continuously with Glance and InMobi central strategy teams in Bangalore.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategy Building&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the GM to develop, stress-test, and iterate the Glance AI strategy — product positioning, business model, monetization architecture, and the moat-building agenda against hyperscalers and regional incumbents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the analytical work behind strategy reviews, board-prep materials, and the annual operating plan. Help ensure positions are backed by data and benchmarks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run targeted deep dives on emerging strategic questions (for example: TV-as-second-surface, AI agent ecosystems, IP and character economy, points and wallet integration) and convert findings into decisions and roadmap commitments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain an active two-way information flow with Glance and InMobi central strategy teams; ensure Japan strategy is consistent with group-level direction and that Japan learnings feed back into central thinking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;High-Impact Project Delivery&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and drive a portfolio of 3–5 cross-functional initiatives at any given time (for example: market entry launches, multi-quarter platform partnerships, organizational rewiring).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring these to closure on tight timelines: set the structure, write the documents, run the cadence, unblock dependencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain the operating rhythm around the GM in Japan — partner reviews, decision logs, follow-through tracking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;External Alliances and Partnerships&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Architect the Japan partner landscape across Glance AI’s strategic vectors — device distribution (carriers, OEMs, retail), commerce destinations, developer ecosystem, AI agent surfaces, and platform partners (TV OS, content, IP holders).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the local Tokyo-based point person who can take partner meetings, attend industry forums, and maintain warm relationships in-market on a cadence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain a live point of view on inorganic options in Japan and the broader region: targets, JV structures, minority investments, acqui-hires.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent the GM in CXO-level conversations with carriers, OEM leadership, platform GMs, regulators, and investor counterparts — either as the warm-up to the GM’s own engagement or in place of it when the GM cannot personally attend. Prepare the GM for their own top-to-tops: briefing memos, partner points of view, decision asks, anticipated objections.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build durable relationships at the COO, Head of Strategy, and Head of BD level at Glance AI’s 20–30 most important counterparts globally, with Japan-based partners as the primary focus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Glance and InMobi&#39;s central Strategy and Corporate Development teams across Bangalore and the US, while working alongside Glance AI Japan functional leaders to drive local market execution and business growth.Qualifications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum 7–10 years of total experience with a mix of: top-tier strategy consulting (McKinsey, BCG, Bain), investment banking M&amp;amp;A advisory; and an operating role at a high-growth technology, consumer-internet, or media company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Based in Tokyo, or willing to relocate to Tokyo, with the legal right to work in Japan (or eligibility to obtain it).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Business-level Japanese language ability (spoken and written) sufficient to operate in partner meetings, navigate counterpart relationships, and engage with the local business community. Fluent English required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written communication; can produce a board-ready memo or deck without heavy editing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel domestically within Japan, regionally across Asia-Pacific, and to Bangalore when needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice-to-have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort operating with ambiguity at the GM or CEO level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of working in a matrixed environment across geographies and influencing without authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to one or more of: AI / ML platforms, consumer mobile (carrier and OEM ecosystems), commerce and e-commerce, media or content businesses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;MBA from a leading institution, or equivalent operating depth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Established personal network into telco, OEM, commerce/retail, and IP-holder CXO communities in Japan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience operating as the senior-most representative of a foreign-headquartered company inside the Japan market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ui-provider ee bcu auz bcv bcw bcx bcy bcz bda bdb bdc bdd bde bdf bdg bdh bdi bdj bdk bdl bdm bdn bdo bdp bdq bdr bds bdt bdu bdv bdw bdx bdy bdz bea&quot;&gt;&quot;&lt;em&gt;Glance collects and processes personal data such as your name, contact details, resume and other information that may contain personal data for the purpose of processing your application. Glance utilizes Greenhouse, a third-party platform. Please review Greenhouse&#39;s Privacy Policy to understand how the data collected from you is processed and managed. By clicking on &#39;Submit Application&#39;, you acknowledge and agree to the above privacy terms. Should you have any privacy concerns, you may contact us through the details mentioned in your application confirmation email.&quot;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;272&quot; data-end=&quot;669&quot;&gt;Glance AI is an AI commerce platform shaping the next wave of e-commerce with inspiration-led shopping, less about searching for what you want and more about discovering who you could be. Operating in 140 countries, Glance AI transforms every screen into a stage for instant, personal, and joyful discovery, where inspiration becomes something you can explore, feel, and shop in the moment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;272&quot; data-end=&quot;669&quot;&gt;Its proprietary models, seamlessly integrated with Google’s most advanced AI platforms, Gemini and Imagen on Vertex AI, deliver hyper-realistic, deeply personal shopping experiences across categories such as fashion, beauty, travel, accessories, home décor, pets, and more. Designed to seamlessly integrate into everyday consumer technology, Glance AI reimagines the future of e-commerce with inspiration-led discovery and shopping.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;671&quot; data-end=&quot;1119&quot;&gt;With an open architecture built for effortless adoption across hardware and software ecosystems, Glance AI is creating a platform that can become a staple in everyday consumer technology. It partners with the world’s leading smartphone makers, connected TV manufacturers, telecom providers, and global brands — meeting people where they are: on mobile, smart TVs, and brand websites.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;671&quot; data-end=&quot;1119&quot;&gt;Through Glance AI’s rich first-party data and unparalleled consumer access, it harnesses InMobi’s global scale, insights, and targeting capabilities to create high-impact, performance-driven shopping journeys for brands worldwide. Part of the InMobi Group, a global technology and advertising leader reaching over 2 billion devices and serving more than 30,000 enterprise brands worldwide, Glance AI is backed by Google, Jio Platforms, and Mithril Capital.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;As Glance scales in Japan, we&#39;re looking for a Senior Market Product Manager to be the voice of the Japanese consumer inside our product organisation. You&#39;ll own parts of the Japan product roadmap — shaping what we build, how we localise it, and how we launch it across our Mobile and connected-TV surfaces. You&#39;ll also set the experience bar for Japan, overseeing and commissioning the UX research and design that keep our product grounded in real user needs. This role blends deep consumer empathy with sharp execution, working closely with global product, design, and engineering in Bangalore while owning the market perspective in Tokyo.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What will you be doing?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Own parts of the Japan product roadmap — defining priorities, shaping requirements, and making sure what we build fits the local market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Be the voice of the Japanese consumer: bring deep user empathy and turn local insight into clear product direction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Lead product launches in Japan end to end, coordinating across global product, engineering, design, growth, and partnerships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Set the experience bar for Japan — overseeing design quality and commissioning UX research (via HQ teams or local partners) to validate key decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Localise and adapt the global product for Japan, from features and content to flows that match local expectations and behaviours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Use research, data, and market signals to prioritise, measure launch impact, and iterate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Key Requirements:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Around 7–10 years in product management, with a track record of owning roadmap and shipping consumer products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Deep consumer empathy and a strong intuition for what makes a product resonate with users — ideally proven in the Japan market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Experience leading product launches end to end in a cross-functional environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;A user-centric approach: able to scope research questions, interpret findings, and hold a high bar for design quality, while partnering with researchers and designers to execute&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559683&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559684&amp;quot;:-2,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Experience influencing senior internal and external stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Preferred Requirements:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Experience as a market or regional PM localising a global product for Japan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Background in mobile consumer apps at scale, ideally with a commerce or content component&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Familiarity with UX research methods and working alongside design and research teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Comfort operating as the local market owner while collaborating with a distributed HQ team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Glance AI&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ownership.&lt;/strong&gt; You will not be confined to one category or one type of partner. You operate where you can also build a portfolio that is genuinely yours.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Structural backing without big-company friction.&lt;/strong&gt; Glance is part of InMobi Group with proven scale (Glance reaches 400M+ monthly users globally) and infrastructure already built, but JP operates as a startup with founding-team on strategy and deals. Backed by strong global investors including SoftBank and Google, with SoftBank as anchor partner in Japan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A first-team seat in Japan.&lt;/strong&gt; The JP strategy is being written now. The partner playbook and deal architecture that will be replicated across other markets such as Korea, Germany, UK, Australia &amp;nbsp;in the future.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Real category creation, not incremental work.&lt;/strong&gt; Work on genuinely new, AI-first agentic commerce — built from the ground up, not an improvement on today&#39;s shopping&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Culture.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Work with smart, humble people who value openness, trust, and honest collaboration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Competitive salary and benefits:&lt;/strong&gt; Benchmarked against roles at comparable global tech in Tokyo, meaningful equity grant, annual performance bonus tied to outcomes, plus full health, retirement, and standard Japan-market benefits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ui-provider ee bcu auz bcv bcw bcx bcy bcz bda bdb bdc bdd bde bdf bdg bdh bdi bdj bdk bdl bdm bdn bdo bdp bdq bdr bds bdt bdu bdv bdw bdx bdy bdz bea&quot;&gt;&quot;&lt;em&gt;Glance collects and processes personal data such as your name, contact details, resume and other information that may contain personal data for the purpose of processing your application. Glance utilizes Greenhouse, a third-party platform. Please review Greenhouse&#39;s Privacy Policy to understand how the data collected from you is processed and managed. By clicking on &#39;Submit Application&#39;, you acknowledge and agree to the above privacy terms. Should you have any privacy concerns, you may contact us through the details mentioned in your application confirmation email.&quot;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;272&quot; data-end=&quot;669&quot;&gt;Glance AI is an AI commerce platform shaping the next wave of e-commerce with inspiration-led shopping, less about searching for what you want and more about discovering who you could be. Operating in 140 countries, Glance AI transforms every screen into a stage for instant, personal, and joyful discovery, where inspiration becomes something you can explore, feel, and shop in the moment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;272&quot; data-end=&quot;669&quot;&gt;Its proprietary models, seamlessly integrated with Google’s most advanced AI platforms, Gemini and Imagen on Vertex AI, deliver hyper-realistic, deeply personal shopping experiences across categories such as fashion, beauty, travel, accessories, home décor, pets, and more. Designed to seamlessly integrate into everyday consumer technology, Glance AI reimagines the future of e-commerce with inspiration-led discovery and shopping.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;671&quot; data-end=&quot;1119&quot;&gt;With an open architecture built for effortless adoption across hardware and software ecosystems, Glance AI is creating a platform that can become a staple in everyday consumer technology. It partners with the world’s leading smartphone makers, connected TV manufacturers, telecom providers, and global brands — meeting people where they are: on mobile, smart TVs, and brand websites.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;671&quot; data-end=&quot;1119&quot;&gt;Through Glance AI’s rich first-party data and unparalleled consumer access, it harnesses InMobi’s global scale, insights, and targeting capabilities to create high-impact, performance-driven shopping journeys for brands worldwide. Part of the InMobi Group, a global technology and advertising leader reaching over 2 billion devices and serving more than 30,000 enterprise brands worldwide, Glance AI is backed by Google, Jio Platforms, and Mithril Capital.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h4 class=&quot;mt-2 -mb-1 text-base font-bold&quot;&gt;Overview of the Role:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;Glance is at an inflection point. With over 250 million daily active users and a platform embedded at the heart of the Android ecosystem, we&#39;re not building for scale...we&#39;re already there. Now, we&#39;re looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Program Manager&lt;/strong&gt; to join our Growth team and help us turn that scale into new markets, new partners, and new revenue.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;This is not a conventional program management role. You won&#39;t just track timelines and file status updates — you&#39;ll be the connective tissue between financial strategy, partner relationships, and execution: modeling the economics of new device deals, arming our partner account teams with the projections they need to negotiate with confidence, pitching new OEM and Telco partners directly, and making sure everything promised in a deal room actually ships on time across our global product and tech teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;If you thrive in ambiguity, move with urgency, and know how to turn a financial model and a partner conversation into a shipped, revenue-generating outcome, this role was built for you. Startup DNA is a must. Hustle is non-negotiable.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;This role is based onsite in our San Mateo, CA, office and is not open to remote work.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h4 class=&quot;mt-2 -mb-1 text-base font-bold&quot;&gt;The Impact You&#39;ll Make&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3 print:block print:space-y-1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Track and drive growth levers.&lt;/strong&gt; Own the levers behind Glance&#39;s Revenue, Device, and DAU growth — monitoring performance across each dimension and translating what you see into the initiatives that move the business forward.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Model the economics of every deal.&lt;/strong&gt; Build the financial models underpinning device acquisition deals across new and existing OEM and Telco partners, sizing the investment and structuring the economics so every deal supports long-term, sustainable growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equip partner teams to close and manage with confidence.&lt;/strong&gt; Arm our partner account management team with the revenue projections and business models they need to manage relationships with OEMs, Telcos, and System Integrators.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pitch and expand our global footprint.&lt;/strong&gt; Take new opportunities directly to OEMs and Telcos across the US, Brazil, Mexico, and Europe, building the relationships and business cases that open new markets for Glance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive execution across continents.&lt;/strong&gt; Partner closely with product and tech teams across the US and Bangalore to keep feature delivery on track, ensuring what&#39;s promised to partners and projected in a model actually ships on time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fuel growth through partner collaboration.&lt;/strong&gt; Work hand-in-hand with system integrators, OEMs, and Telcos to drive app updates and unlock meaningful DAU growth across Glance&#39;s device footprint.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h4 class=&quot;mt-2 -mb-1 text-base font-bold&quot;&gt;The Experience We Need:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3 print:block print:space-y-1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;6–8+ years of program or partner management experience, ideally with exposure to device, telecom, or platform ecosystems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Demonstrated experience building financial and deal models: comfortable owning the numbers behind a partnership, not just the relationship.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Strong track record managing complex, cross-functional programs across distributed teams and time zones (experience spanning US and India-based teams a plus).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Experience working directly with OEMs, Telcos, or System Integrators: familiarity with device ecosystems and distribution economics highly valued.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Comfortable operating with significant ambiguity and driving alignment without formal authority over the teams you depend on.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Exceptional communication and executive presence — able to pitch a business case to a Telco in São Paulo and align an engineering team in Bangalore in the same week.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Analytical fluency: able to translate growth data (DAU, device activations, revenue) into the story behind a deal or a delivery plan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Startup or high-growth environment background preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
