&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pristine Visual Portfolio:&lt;/strong&gt; A portfolio demonstrating world-class graphic craft, advanced composition, layout sophistication, and an editorial eye applied to digital screens or consumer products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interface Fundamentals:&lt;/strong&gt; Absolute command over typography, grid systems, aspect ratios, color theory, and optical alignment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Systemic Thinking:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven experience designing UI component systems that adapt gracefully across varying screen densities, aspect ratios, hardware limitations, and localised multi-lingual feeds.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tooling Fluency:&lt;/strong&gt; Expert command of Figma and modern asset optimisation pipelines, with an obsessive eye for the 1px details that separate standard layouts from elite software products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated history of designing for visual-first, style, luxury, or fashion-led digital media platforms where imagery, curation, and brand aesthetics are inseparable from product utility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to work side-by-side with engineering teams to inspect, review, and refine shipped production UI, ensuring absolute visual fidelity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;=A Bachelors, Masters, or Post-Graduate degree in Visual Communication, Graphic Design, Fine Arts, Communication Design, or a related visual field.&lt;/p&gt;
