&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top: 0in; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; color: black;&quot;&gt;Self-motivated and able to make decisions and exercise prudent judgement with minimal guidance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
